  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      it would be nice to have an includes / excludes of artifacts on dependency<br/>
description. It would enabled someone to use a dependent ivy module in its own<br/>
way, a way that the writer of the dependent ivy file had not think about.<br/>
<br/>
The includes / excludes would work like in ant, and could be applied to direct<br/>
dependencies or all depdencies.<br/>
<br/>
It would filter artifacts only.
