</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Operating System: Windows XP<br/>
Platform: PC
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      We have 3 modules : BasicModule, InterModule, MasterModule that declares the<br/>
following ivy confs.<br/>
<br/>
BasicModule<br/>
conf : <br/>
   conf1 publishes bm-artefact1<br/>
   conf2 publishes bm-artefact2<br/>
<br/>
InterModule<br/>
conf :<br/>
   default<br/>
dependency :<br/>
   BasicModule : default-&gt;conf1<br/>
<br/>
MasterModule<br/>
conf :<br/>
   default<br/>
dependency :<br/>
   BasicModule : default-&gt;conf2<br/>
   InterModule : default-&gt;default<br/>
<br/>
BasicModule is set to publish in local mode.<br/>
<br/>
The resolve in MasterModule evicts then it&#39;s dependencies on InterModule as<br/>
required but then do not retreive bm-artefact1 that is required by InterModule.
  </td>
