                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Ivy downloads artifacts that are not needed at all. The problem was found in a project that depends on hibernate 3.0.5 and another library that needed hibernate 2.1.8. The 2.1.8 depends on the &#39;odbg&#39; module, but 3.0.5 don&#39;t; the 2.1.8 was evicted, but the odmg was downloaded.<br/>
I think ivy shouldn&#39;t dowload odmg because there isn&#39;t a module that depends on it.
