</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice to be able to find what artifacts would be returned if only the cache was used, a sort of &quot;cache resolver&quot;. This would allow tools like necessitas to let the user see what is available locally and (using the new list repository functionality) what is available from central storage.
