                <tr id="issuerow12356660" rel="12356660" data-issuekey="IVY-52" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-52" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-52">IVY-52</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Configuration mapping to self [*-&gt;@]
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Rick Riemer
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Rick Riemer
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 05/Jul/05 17:06 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Sep/05 16:05 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be useful to have a dependency configuration map to the active (or &#39;self&#39;) configuration.<br/>
<br/>
For example, consider two projects A and B, with three configurations each &#39;ct&#39; (compile-time), &#39;tt&#39; (test-time) and &#39;rt&#39; (run-time). Project B depends on project A in the same configuration, i.e.:<br/>
&lt;dependency name=&quot;A&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot; conf=&quot;ct-&gt;ct;tt-&gt;tt;rt-&gt;rt&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
If a configuration is added, this requires quite some maintenance, while it just says: in all configurations, map to &#39;self&#39;. Suggested is to add a mapping *-&gt;@, meaning: in all configurations map to self.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
