                <tr id="issuerow12356661" rel="12356661" data-issuekey="IVY-53" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-53" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-53">IVY-53</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                add an error message when a resolver directly uses the cache
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Jul/05 13:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Sep/05 16:04 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For the moment if a resolver is configured to use the cache, it attempts to copy files to themselves, and it causes problems. The detection of such configuration should be added and an appropriate error message should then be displayed.
