                <tr id="issuerow12356665" rel="12356665" data-issuekey="IVY-57" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-57" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-57">IVY-57</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Report header contains incorrect link after resolve for multiple, comma-separated configurations
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Trivial
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Rick Riemer
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Rick Riemer
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Jul/05 12:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Sep/05 16:03 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.1,                     1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When generating a report after resolving multiple configurations, the report header contains an incorrect link.<br/>
<br/>
For example, when using the following two lines:<br/>
&lt;code&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:resolve conf=&quot;ct,tt,rt&quot; showprogress=&quot;false&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:report todir=&quot;&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/code&gt;<br/>
<br/>
the report header contains a link to &lt;cite&gt;file:///C:/dev/views/zeist/cispd/build/ivy-results/gehcit.cip-codeloader-ct,tt,rt.html&lt;/cite&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The link should however be three links, one to each configuration each. The actual &#39;ct&#39;, &#39;tt&#39; and &#39;rt&#39; configurations are there. If the resolve is separated into three resolves (one for each configuration), the links are correctly generated.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll put this issue into Jira as a small issue (has no impact on Ivy working, more of a typo).
  </td>
