                <tr id="issuerow12356666" rel="12356666" data-issuekey="IVY-58" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-58" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-58">IVY-58</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ivy files in the cache aren&#39;t updated
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Cannot Reproduce
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Jul/05 10:11 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Oct/05 13:12 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
If there was no ivy file in the repository -&gt; a default ivy file is added to the cache. If the ivy file is added to the repository some time later, the cached ivy file isn&#39;t updated (even if the timestamp in the repository is more recent than the cached timestamp). I think Ivy should at least check if there is an update for these default ivy files.<br/>
<br/>
regards,<br/>
Maarten
  </td>
