                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The module descriptor writer blindly outputs module descriptor attributes without checking for null.<br/>
<br/>
So the descriptor in the cache ends up with &quot;null&quot;:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;info organisation=&quot;jayasoft&quot; module=&quot;depending&quot; revision=&quot;working@hostname&quot; status=&quot;null&quot;/&gt;<br/>

  </td>
