</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For incremental builds it would be useful to know if there were any dependency changes since the last resolve. This way incremental builds can detect that .jars do not have to be rebuilt when nothing changed.<br/>
<br/>
Suggested is a property available after a ivy:resolve call, which tells whether there were any changes since the last resolve.
  </td>
