                <tr id="issuerow12356686" rel="12356686" data-issuekey="IVY-78" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-78" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-78">IVY-78</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Reduce verboseness of ivy console messages for ant
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Karl Baum
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Karl Baum
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Sep/05 17:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/06 15:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      ant
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      For the normal usage of ivy, there are too many console messages.  Although these messages may be useful to someone setting up ivy, they can give the impression ivy is for more invasive to the ant build then it really is.   The average developer building a project does not need to see these ivy messages.  I think an additional ant attribute to control the verboseness of the ivy messages is needed.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks.<br/>
<br/>
-karl
  </td>
