                <tr id="issuerow12356704" rel="12356704" data-issuekey="IVY-96" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-96" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-96">IVY-96</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ability to use a dependency instead of an ivy file in standalone mode
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Oct/05 15:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Jan/06 15:41 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be nice to be able to specify a dependency that need to be resolved in standlone mode instead of needing to write an ivy file.<br/>
<br/>
Proposed syntax:<br/>
ivy -dependency org module rev<br/>
<br/>
Is equivalent to <br/>
ivy -ivy ivy.xml<br/>
<br/>
with ivy.xml:<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;<br/>
	&lt;info organisation=&quot;org&quot;<br/>
		module=&quot;standalone&quot;<br/>
		revision=&quot;working&quot;<br/>
	/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
		&lt;dependency org=&quot;org&quot; name=&quot;module&quot; rev=&quot;rev&quot; conf=&quot;default-&gt;*&quot;/&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>

  </td>
