                <tr id="issuerow12356705" rel="12356705" data-issuekey="IVY-97" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-97" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-97">IVY-97</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Project Dependencies causing errors between projects
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Roshan Punnoose
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Roshan Punnoose
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Oct/05 08:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Dec/05 18:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        unspecified            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ant 1.6.5, JDK 1.4.2
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the latest release of code, project interdependencies cause problems in resolving dependencies. For example, if I have project A and project B, and project A&#39;s dependencies go as:<br/>
<br/>
-log4j<br/>
-junit<br/>
<br/>
and project B&#39;s dependencies go as:<br/>
<br/>
-project A (latest-integration)<br/>
-log4j<br/>
-junit.<br/>
<br/>
I will get a NullPointerException in the Ivy.resolve() for project B. However, if my dependencies are written as:<br/>
<br/>
-log4j<br/>
-junit<br/>
-project A<br/>
<br/>
with project A declared after the other interdependencies, it will work fine. This is my temporary workaround.
  </td>
