                <tr id="issuerow12356709" rel="12356709" data-issuekey="IVY-101" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-101" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-101">IVY-101</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ability to rebuild all dependent projects from a leaf
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Karl Baum
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Karl Baum
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Oct/05 10:08 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/Nov/06 12:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      all
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      In a multiproject build, when making a change to a subproject, we would like to easily rebuild all dependent projects.  This could be implemented as an extension to the buildlist ant tag by adding a dependsOn attriubte which takes a module name as an argument.<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy:buildlist skipbuildwithoutivy=&quot;true&quot; reference=&quot;dependent-buildpath&quot; dependsOn=&quot;myCurrentModule&quot;&gt;<br/>
     &lt;fileset dir=&quot;&quot; includes=&quot;**/build.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy:buildlist&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The dependsOn attribute value myCurrentModule represents the current module which is changing.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks.<br/>
<br/>
-karl
  </td>
