  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      It may be useful to have the ability to set the transitive property to false at the configuration level.  An example would be for compile time dependencies.  Here we want to stop our code from depending on third partly libraries pulled in from other projects&#39; dependencies.  Please see the following forum post:<br/>
<br/>
http://jayasoft.org/node/315<br/>
<br/>
Thx.<br/>
<br/>
-karl
