                <tr id="issuerow12356719" rel="12356719" data-issuekey="IVY-111" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-111" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-111">IVY-111</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Empty dependency set gives erroneous fileset
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matt Inger
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matt Inger
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Dec/05 14:20 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Jan/06 15:24 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a configuration named &quot;tld&quot;, which ends up having no files in it for certain projects.<br/>
I am writing a generic ant build file which will be included into other files.  So, for the building<br/>
of the war file, I want to put all tld dependencies in the WEB-INF/tld folder.<br/>
<br/>
I then try to create a fileset/path using ivy:cachefileset/ivy:cachepath<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;ivy:cachefileset setid=&quot;runtime.tld.fileset&quot; conf=&quot;runtime&quot; type=&quot;tld&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
And then, I try to copy this fileset to my staging directory:<br/>
<br/>
      &lt;copy todir=&quot;/webstage/WEB-INF/tld&quot; flatten=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;fileset refid=&quot;runtime.tld.fileset&quot; /&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/copy&gt;<br/>
<br/>
I would expect the fileset to be empty, and it is.  However, if you then try<br/>
to copy, it copies the entire cache directory for some reason (perhaps<br/>
an issue with the copy ask).  I guess it&#39;s not adding any kind of selector. <br/>
If cachepath is creating an empty fileset, it should have a **/*.&lt;type&gt; selector on it.<br/>
<br/>
I realize it&#39;s probably an ANT issue, but if it could be workd around in IVY, it would<br/>
help, as fixes take a l real long time to make their way into ANT.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
