    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Dec/05 19:33 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 01/Nov/06 12:20 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The publication of artifacts from different directories is not possible, because  I can only set ONE artifactspattern in the ivy:publish task.<br/>
Code-Example:<br/>
&lt;target name=&quot;publish&quot; depends=&quot;resolve&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;ivy:publish artifactspattern=&quot;/[artifact].[ext]&quot;<br/>
            resolver=&quot;publisher&quot;<br/>
            pubrevision=&quot;&quot;<br/>
            status=&quot;release&quot;<br/>
        /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/target&gt;<br/>
It  would be helpful to create something like an artifacts pattern list.<br/>
<br/>
See also forum node 306
  </td>
