                <tr id="issuerow12356736" rel="12356736" data-issuekey="IVY-128" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-128" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-128">IVY-128</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Addition of Vfs Resolver which uses Commons-Vfs to resolve files
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Stephen Nesbitt
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matt Inger
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matt Inger
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Jan/06 12:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Sep/06 19:55 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is being entered in order to submit a new Resolver / Repository combination which will use apache commons-vfs to perform resource resolution.  This will enable users to use protocols like sftp, webdav, ftp, cifs, etc.... to resolve dependencies and publish files.  Personally, I have succesfully used the sftp protocol to publish and retrieve files, and will be adding test cases shortly.  The initial submission will only include the source code changes.<br/>
<br/>
The following is now allowed in the ivy-conf.xml file:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;vfs name=&quot;vfs-resolver&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;sftp://username:password@host/pattern&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;sftp://username:password@host/pattern&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/vfs&gt;<br/>

  </td>
