</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In some quite complex cases conflict resolution does not work as expected. Here is the case which seems to causes the problem:<br/>
A depends on <br/>
- D v1 and forces it<br/>
- B v1<br/>
B v1 depends on <br/>
- D v2<br/>
- C v1<br/>
C v1 depends on <br/>
- D v2<br/>
<br/>
In this case D v2 is not properly evicted<br/>

  </td>
