</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-135" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-135">IVY-135</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Duplicate dependencies drastically slows down resolve
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matt Inger
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matt Inger
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Jan/06 15:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Aug/06 18:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It seems that if i have duplicates of the same dependency, the resolve task drastically slows down.<br/>
I&#39;m seeing anywhere from a 1 - 10x slowdown.<br/>
<br/>
Basically, I have:<br/>
<br/>
Module A<br/>
  depends on jar X<br/>
<br/>
Module B<br/>
  depends on jar X<br/>
  depends on Module A<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
If i take out the B dependency on X, then the speed dramatically increases.<br/>
I&#39;ll work on an isolated test case, but it seems to me that duplicate dependencies shouldn&#39;t slow down<br/>
the system like that.<br/>

  </td>
