                <tr id="issuerow12356742" rel="12356742" data-issuekey="IVY-134" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-134" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-134">IVY-134</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Review default conf mapping management
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Jan/06 19:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/Jan/06 16:13 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Today when one specify a default conf mapping in its ivy file, it is used only when no conf mapping is declared for a dependency.<br/>
<br/>
What would be nice is to use it also if a conf mapping is given with no right operande.<br/>
For instance, if I declare &quot;compile-&gt;@;test-&gt;compile&quot; as default mapping, then if I declare a dependency like this:<br/>
&lt;dependency name=&quot;dep&quot; rev=&quot;rev&quot; conf=&quot;test&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Then it would be nice to interpret conf=&quot;test&quot; as conf=&quot;test-&gt;compile&quot; according to the default conf mapping.
  </td>
