</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                do not add resolver info in ivy files in cache so that they can be safely used as usual ivy files in a repository
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
