                <tr id="issuerow12356749" rel="12356749" data-issuekey="IVY-141" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-141" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-141">IVY-141</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                install modules found in one resolver into another resolver
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Jan/06 12:08 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 23/Jan/06 20:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Some people only use private repositories to avoid public repositories problems (latency, maintenance, accuracy, ...). The problem is that maintaining such private repositories can be quite time consuming.<br/>
<br/>
The purpose of this feature request is to allow users to define an access to a public resolver, which is only used to download modules in a private repository. Then the modules in the private repository can be checked to see if they meet the private repository constraints, but the initial download is much easier.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
