</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-149" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-149">IVY-149</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Problem with inheritance between private conf and public conf
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Matthieu Brouillard
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Matthieu Brouillard
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Jan/06 10:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Jan/06 11:19 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In a spring ivy xml we have something like<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;conf name=&quot;orm&quot;                description=&quot;Hibernate support, JDO support, Apache OJB, iBATIS SQL Maps support&quot; extends=&quot;dao&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;conf name=&quot;hibernate&quot;          description=&quot;Hibernate 2.x support&quot; extends=&quot;orm&quot; visibility=&quot;private&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;conf name=&quot;hibernate2-orm&quot;     description=&quot;Hibernate 2.x support&quot; extends=&quot;hibernate&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;conf name=&quot;hibernate3-orm&quot;     description=&quot;Hibernate 3.x support&quot; extends=&quot;hibernate&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
When trying to resolve hibernate3-orm configuration from our project cause an error.<br/>
<br/>
 WARN:   ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::<br/>
 WARN:   ::          UNRESOLVED DEPENDENCIES         ::<br/>
 WARN:   ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::<br/>
 WARN:   :: [ springframework | springframework | 1.2.6 ]: configuration not public in [ springframework | springframework | 1.2.6 ]: hibernate. It was required from [ jayasoft | woj-portal | working@rahan ] default<br/>
 WARN:   ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::<br/>

  </td>
