</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      all
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Instead of generating a graph from one module (ivy.xml file)and seeing what that module depends on, it would be great if we could somehow see how all of our modules relate to each other in one large dependency graph.<br/>
<br/>
Please see: http://www.jayasoft.org/node/437<br/>
<br/>
Thx.<br/>
<br/>
-karl
  </td>
