                <tr id="issuerow12356765" rel="12356765" data-issuekey="IVY-158" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-158" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-158">IVY-158</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                HTML report shouldn&#39;t display the dependencies of evicted modules
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Jan/06 17:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/06 15:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Hi,<br/>
<br/>
if a module is evicted by another revision, the HTML report incorrectly shows a list of dependencies of the evicted module.<br/>
<br/>
For instance: suppose module3 v1.0 is evicted by module3 v1.1. Module3 v1.0 has a dependency on module4 and module3 v1.1 has a dependency on module5<br/>
<br/>
The current report looks like this:<br/>
<br/>
Dependencies Overview:<br/>
module1<br/>
module2<br/>
-- module3 (v1.0) EVICTED<br/>
---- module5                  !!! INCORRECT !!!<br/>
-- module3 (v1.1)<br/>
----module5<br/>
<br/>
The correct report should look like:<br/>
<br/>
Dependencies Overview:<br/>
module1<br/>
module2<br/>
-- module3 (v1.0) EVICTED<br/>
-- module3 (v1.1)<br/>
----module5<br/>
<br/>
As you can see, the dependencies of the evicted module are no longer listed.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll upload a patch.<br/>
<br/>
regards,<br/>
Maarten
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="27/Jan/06 18:25"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2006-01-27T18:25:47+0000">27/Jan/06 6:25 PM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312521">    11 years, 25 weeks, 2 days ago

                        </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312320"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310420">      139900
  </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312321"></td>
