                                            <td class="environment">      ivy &gt; 1.3RC1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When getting available revisions for a module, a resolver that has ivy and artifact patterns set uses those both resolvers to build the revision list.<br/>
This can be probematic for modules having multiple artifacts.<br/>
<br/>
Suppose that your module defines 2 artifacts : mod and mod-test<br/>
You have in a repository the module in the revision 1.0.<br/>
Asking for revisions to a file resolver configured on this repository will answer : 1.0 and test-1.0 as found revisions.
  </td>
