                <tr id="issuerow12356776" rel="12356776" data-issuekey="IVY-169" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-169" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-169">IVY-169</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy post resolve tasks like retrieve or cachepath should be able to run from cache information
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Feb/06 16:31 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Feb/06 15:16 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For the moment if you run a retrieve whereas no resolve was previously called in the same build, one is automatically run.<br/>
<br/>
Ivy has enough information in cache and in retrieve task attributes (module, organisation, conf) to be able to run without a call to resolve if one was done in a previous build.
  </td>
