                <tr id="issuerow12356780" rel="12356780" data-issuekey="IVY-173" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-173" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-173">IVY-173</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                latest-revision conflict manager evicts all versions of a module
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Tarik Idris
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Tarik Idris
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 14/Feb/06 13:45 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Mar/06 19:09 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.3-RC3            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ivy 1.3-rc1 and latest build (14:30 on 10.02.2006)
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The latest-revision conflict manager evicts all versions of a module (commons-collections). Here is a snip from the<br/>
xml resolution report in cache:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;module organisation=&quot;apache&quot; name=&quot;commons-collections&quot; resolver=&quot;epr&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;revision name=&quot;3.1&quot; status=&quot;release&quot; pubdate=&quot;20040628200200&quot; resolver=&quot;remote_chain&quot; evicted=&quot;latest-revision&quot; homepage=&quot;http://jakarta.apache.org/commons/collections/&quot; downloaded=&quot;true&quot; searched=&quot;true&quot; default=&quot;false&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;license name=&quot;Apache&quot; url=&quot;http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;caller organisation=&quot;displaytag&quot; name=&quot;displaytag&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; rev=&quot;2.1.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;caller organisation=&quot;apache&quot; name=&quot;commons-digester&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; rev=&quot;2.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;caller organisation=&quot;foo&quot; name=&quot;foo1&quot; conf=&quot;compile&quot; rev=&quot;3.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;caller organisation=&quot;foo&quot; name=&quot;foo2&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; rev=&quot;3.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;caller organisation=&quot;foo&quot; name=&quot;foo3&quot; conf=&quot;compile&quot; rev=&quot;3.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;caller organisation=&quot;hibernate&quot; name=&quot;hibernate&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; rev=&quot;2.1.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;caller organisation=&quot;apache&quot; name=&quot;velocity&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; rev=&quot;3.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
