</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The default cache artifact pattern in class &#39;Ivy&#39; is currently set to &#39;[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&#39;. If an artifact without an extension is found it will have a trailing dot in the filename in the cache (not on Windows). When the pattern is changed to &#39;[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[artifact]-[revision](.[ext])&#39; the dot will not be appended if the artifact does not have an extension.
  </td>
