                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Ivy 1.3 has a problem with conflict resolution in transitive dependencies:<br/>
A depends on B<br/>
B depends on C and D 1.1 (in this order)<br/>
C depends on D 1.0<br/>
<br/>
In this case both D 1.1 and D 1.0 are evicted, whereas only D 1.0 should.
