                <tr id="issuerow12356809" rel="12356809" data-issuekey="IVY-202" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-202" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-202">IVY-202</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support for circular dependencies
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andy Hedges
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andy Hedges
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Mar/06 12:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Oct/06 15:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      There are occasions, such as with inherited projects, where circular dependencies exist and it would be nice if these could be represented in ivy.<br/>
<br/>
For example int the four project situation where<br/>
<br/>
ProjectA --&gt; ProjectB --&gt; ProjectC --&gt; ProjectA<br/>
<br/>
ivy should note that there is a circular dependency but not error.<br/>
<br/>
The ability to generate graphml on this would be useful too.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="07/Jul/06 09:04"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2006-07-07T09:04:32+0000">07/Jul/06 9:04 AM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312521">    10 years, 41 weeks, 2 days ago

