                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I have two depedencies each of them depends on xerces, for example, and I don&#39;t want to download xerces, I have to add &lt;exclude/&gt; tag near description of each dependency. That&#39;s not handy, I think ivy.xml shoud accept &lt;exclude/&gt; tag as child of &lt;dependencies/&gt; element, to exclude specified dependency from all dependencies.
  </td>
