</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Allow specifying something like:<br/>
compile-&gt;compile;[all-other-configs]-&gt;default<br/>
where [all-other-configs] mean all configurations not mapped by the other mappings in the defaultconfmapping.<br/>
<br/>
[all-other-configs] could be specified by special characters like &#39;%&#39; or &#39;+&#39; or ... <br/>
<br/>
For more information, see http://www.jayasoft.org/node/589 point 3.<br/>
<br/>
regards,<br/>
Maarten
  </td>
