                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have been unable to get ivy 1.3.1 working against an authenticated https server. I tracked down the issue and its turns out to be due to HttpClient defaulting to NTLM authentication if the server supports it. The Ivy helper class doesn&#39;t support NTLM though so downloads will fail. 
  </td>
