                <tr id="issuerow12356824" rel="12356824" data-issuekey="IVY-217" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-217" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-217">IVY-217</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                add possibility to define extra attributes in ivy files
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Apr/06 10:08 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Aug/06 14:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It is already possible with ivy to disable ivy file validation, and so to be able to add extra attributes anywhere. The problem is that this information is not extracted from the ivy file and is thus not usable, except by writing a custom ivy file parser, which would consist mainly in a copy of the original one, thus causing maintenance problem.<br/>
<br/>
This feature would give an access to these extra attributes, at least from a custom resolver for example. Having a map of all attributes for the dependency and artifact tag can be a good idea to start with.
  </td>
