                <tr id="issuerow12356828" rel="12356828" data-issuekey="IVY-221" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-221" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-221">IVY-221</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add option to cachepath task to create a path with local artifact paths
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 18/Apr/06 11:18 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Aug/06 09:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be cool to have an option to retrieve the original location for local artifacts with the cachepath task.<br/>
<br/>
For instance:<br/>
&lt;cachepath pathid=&quot;default.classpath&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; useOrigin=&quot;true&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
the behaviour is like this when &#39;useOrigin=true&#39;:<br/>
- if the artifact is not local, the location from within the cache is used<br/>
- if the artifact is a local artifact, it&#39;s original location is returned<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll upload a patch in a minute.<br/>
<br/>
regards,<br/>
Maarten
  </td>
