                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I need to provide some extra XSLT parameters to my custom XSL in the report task. Currently, there is no way to pass them to my XSL file.<br/>
The report task could be extended to make this possible.<br/>
<br/>
For instance:<br/>
&lt;ivy:report xslfile=&quot;myxsl.xsl&quot; xslext=&quot;xml&quot; &gt;<br/>
    &lt;ivy:param name=&quot;myparam&quot; expression=&quot;value&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;ivy:param name=&quot;anotherparam&quot; expression=&quot;value2&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy:report&gt;<br/>

  </td>
