  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The module and artifact in ivy.xml in the repo always contains the values of the first published module in ant:<br/>
Steps I do:<br/>
&lt;ivy:resolve file=&quot;/foo.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:publish artifactspattern=&quot;//lib/[artifact].[ext]&quot; resolver=&quot;shared&quot; pubrevision=&quot;@{release}&quot; status=&quot;integration&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:resolve file=&quot;/bar.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:publish artifactspattern=&quot;//lib/[artifact].[ext]&quot; resolver=&quot;shared&quot; pubrevision=&quot;@{release}&quot; status=&quot;integration&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Now the ivy.xml from bar.xml contains the module and artifact-values from foo.xml
  </td>
