                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When you generate for instance a html report (or a graphml report), a new XSLT processor is created for every file-transformation. If you have a lot of configurations, this means a lot of unnecessary creations of XSLT processors.<br/>
<br/>
I&#39;ll upload a patch (which also fixes issue IVY-246)
