                <tr id="issuerow12356855" rel="12356855" data-issuekey="IVY-248" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-248" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-248">IVY-248</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                report Ant-task doesn&#39;t call init() on the internal XSLTProcess
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/May/06 18:24 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Aug/06 18:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:04 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The report task doesn&#39;t call the init() method on the internal XSLTProcess instance.<br/>
This results in an unitialized XMLCatalog and could cause failures in custom stylesheets.<br/>
<br/>
The fix is as follows (sorry but I cannot create a patch right now):<br/>
<br/>
Add &quot;xslt.init();&quot; to the genreport and gengraph methods.<br/>
<br/>
For instance:<br/>
<br/>
XSLTProcess xslt = new XSLTProcess();<br/>
xslt.setTaskName(getTaskName());<br/>
xslt.setProject(getProject());<br/>
xslt.setBasedir(cache);<br/>
xslt.init();   // ADD THIS<br/>

  </td>
