                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have no space left in /tmp. When executed &quot;ant retrieve&quot; I&#39;ve got the message<br/>
<br/>
===<br/>
WARN: problem while downloading ivy file: http://somewhere/ivyrep/springframework/spring/2.0-m4/ivy.xml: No space left on device<br/>
===<br/>
<br/>
Message should be something like:<br/>
<br/>
WARN: problem while downloading ivy file: http://somewhere/ivyrep/springframework/spring/2.0-m4/ivy.xml to /tmp/xxx-yyy.jar: No space left on device<br/>
<br/>
To easier find where is problem.
