                <tr id="issuerow12356868" rel="12356868" data-issuekey="IVY-261" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-261" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-261">IVY-261</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Wrong resolution of dependencies if artifacts specified explicitly
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stepan Koltsov
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stepan Koltsov
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Jun/06 08:05 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Aug/06 18:25 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.3.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Let we have module &quot;bebe&quot; rev 15.16.17 with specified dependencies:<br/>
<br/>
===<br/>
&lt;dependency name=&quot;org.springframework&quot; rev=&quot;2.0-rc1&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;artifact name=&quot;spring-core&quot; type=&quot;jar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
===<br/>
<br/>
This module has jar and ivy.xml uploaded to some repository. And have our main program with dependencies:<br/>
<br/>
===<br/>
&lt;dependency name=&quot;bebe&quot; rev=&quot;15.16.17&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;dependency name=&quot;org.springframework&quot; rev=&quot;2.0-rc1&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;artifact name=&quot;spring-core&quot; type=&quot;jar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;artifact name=&quot;spring-dao&quot; type=&quot;jar&quot;/&gt; &lt;!-- Line added --&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
===<br/>
<br/>
After invoking ant retrieve in main program build file, artifact spring-dao won&#39;t get into my target jars directory, there will be only spring-core.jar.<br/>
<br/>
I don&#39;t even know workaround...
  </td>
