                <tr id="issuerow12356871" rel="12356871" data-issuekey="IVY-264" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-264" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-264">IVY-264</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Multiple versions of dependencies appearing in retrieve
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            David Browne
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            David Browne
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Jul/06 14:04 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 28/Aug/06 18:35 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have, in module &quot;a&quot;:<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;dependency name=&quot;x&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot; conf=&quot;default-&gt;default&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency name=&quot;y&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot; conf=&quot;default-&gt;default&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency name=&quot;z&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot; conf=&quot;default-&gt;default&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
and, in module x AND z:<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;dependency name=&quot;commons-lang&quot; rev=&quot;1.0.1&quot; conf=&quot;default-&gt;default&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
and, in module y:<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;dependency name=&quot;commons-lang&quot; rev=&quot;2.0&quot; conf=&quot;default-&gt;default&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Module &quot;a&quot; ends up with BOTH versions of commons lang.<br/>
<br/>
Note that if the order of the dependencies in &quot;a&quot; is changed so that &quot;y&quot; is not in the middle, it works fine.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
