</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It would be great if I could specify URL, where artifact can be downloaded from, like<br/>
<br/>
&lt;artifact url=&quot;http://some-location/lib.jar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
It could be useful, for example, if some library is released but not yet uploaded to ibiblio (Spring 2.0-rc3 is released today, but not on ibilblio yet), so I could use latest version right now, and drop url attribute when uploaded.
  </td>
