                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Ivy home page is VERY simple, maybe too much. The layout and content can be improved, with a nice download &amp; documentation button, a bit more text about what it is, and maybe some nice graphic...<br/>
See also if latest posts title from the forum can find their way here, and maybe latest announcements too (if it isn&#39;t too complicated).<br/>
<br/>
I also think I will change the main subtitle from &quot;managing your dependencies&quot; to &quot;the agile dependency manager&quot;. One buzzword isn&#39;t too much for a home page, is it :-)
