</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      ant with an XMLLogger
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The ivy log messages are not embedded in their target/task tags when an xml logger is used in ANT.<br/>
<br/>
To fix that, the AntMessageImpl should pass the current task when invoking _project.log.  (Could receive it from IvyTask.ensureMessageInitialized directly or via a ThreadLocal if you want to suport  multithread build).<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
This is anoying when running in cruise control.  Indeed by default cruise control only looks for log messages into target/task element.
  </td>
