  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have in module A dependency to module B and C, module B has dependency to module C with different artifacts than module A. Dependency to module B is before dependency to module C in ivy.xml of module A and build fails because artifacts of dependency C (in module A) aren&#39;t retrieved. When I change order so that dependency of module C is before dependency of module B in ivy.xml of module A then artifacts of module C of both dependencies (module A and module B) are retrieved and build successes.
  </td>
