                <tr id="issuerow12356900" rel="12356900" data-issuekey="IVY-293" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-293" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-293">IVY-293</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                vfs resolver does not find &quot;latest.integration&quot; using webdav
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Antoine Sabot-Durand
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Antoine Sabot-Durand
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 11/Sep/06 10:19 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Sep/06 18:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Java 1.4, Windows XP, Ant 1.6.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      This is copied from IVY-243 <br/>
<br/>
I am working with SVN HEAD (so kind of ivy 1.4). I am interesting in using a vfs resolver, which I have configured to use webdav.<br/>
<br/>
my resolver tag is the following :<br/>
<br/>
                 &lt;vfs name=&quot;vfs-resolver&quot;&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;webdav://admin:****@dev-build:85/ivyrep/[organisation]/[module].[revision]/ivy.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
                        &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;webdav://admin:****@dev-build:85/ivyrep/[organisation]/[module].[revision]/[artifact].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
                &lt;/vfs&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
Publishing works fine.<br/>
<br/>
[ivy:publish] published standalone to webdav://admin:****@dev-build:85/ivyrep/jayasoft/standalone.1/standalone.jar<br/>
[ivy:publish] published ivy to webdav://admin:****@dev-build:85/ivyrep/jayasoft/standalone.1/ivy.xml<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
But latest.integration cannot be found either.<br/>
<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] no resolved descriptor found: launching default resolve<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] using ivy parser to parse file:/C:/cc_views_dr_3_2/cbrm/qa/components/dependence/depending/ivy.xml<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] :: resolving dependencies :: [ jayasoft | depending | working@alambertxpdt ]<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] confs: [default]<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] validate = true<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] Available VFS schemes...<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] VFS Supported Scheme: file<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] VFS Supported Scheme: sftp<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] VFS Supported Scheme: tmp<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] VFS Supported Scheme: webdav<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] no proxy configured<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] using commons httpclient 3.x helper<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] no resolved descriptor found: launching default resolve<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] using ivy parser to parse file:/C:/cc_views_dr_3_2/cbrm/qa/components/dependence/depending/ivy.xml<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] :: resolving dependencies :: [ jayasoft | depending | working@alambertxpdt ]<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] confs: [default]<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] validate = true<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] Available VFS schemes...<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] VFS Supported Scheme: file<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] VFS Supported Scheme: sftp<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] VFS Supported Scheme: tmp<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] VFS Supported Scheme: webdav<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] no proxy configured<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] using commons httpclient 3.x helper<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] Could not determine the last modified timestamp of &quot;webdav://admin:*******@dev-build:85/ivyrep/jayasoft/standalone.latest.integration/ivy.xml&quot; because it does not exist.<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] Could not determine the size of &quot;webdav://admin:*******@dev-build:85/ivyrep/jayasoft&quot; because it is not a file.<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] Could not determine the last modified timestamp of &quot;webdav://admin:*******@dev-build:85/ivyrep/jayasoft/standalone.latest.integration/standalone.jar&quot; because it does not exist.<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] Could not determine the size of &quot;webdav://admin:*******@dev-build:85/ivyrep/jayasoft&quot; because it is not a file.<br/>
[ivy:retrieve] vfs-resolver: no ivy file nor artifact found for [ jayasoft | standalone | latest.integration ]<br/>
