 think the issue you have with vfs is not really related to the problem of SNAPSHOT with maven (which is not a supported feature right now), while what you test should be. Could you please copy paste your report in a new bug? Then maybe you could try also to set alwaysCheckExactRevision to false on your resolver, to avoid the tests on &#39;latest.integration&#39; as a revision, and get only the log for what the resolver attempt to do to list the revisions. Then maybe using the debug log level could learn us more about what&#39;s happening. I have no environment to test webdav myself, so if anybody else can help...<br/>
