                <tr id="issuerow12356903" rel="12356903" data-issuekey="IVY-296" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-296" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-296">IVY-296</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                invalid sha1 when trying to resolve dependencies
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Gill
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            John Gill
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 15/Sep/06 13:06 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 15/Sep/06 11:05 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      pre-release of 1.4 (ivy-20060914225930)
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      In my Ivy file I have <br/>
&lt;code type=&quot;xml&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;dependency org=&quot;apache&quot; name=&quot;commons-logging&quot; rev=&quot;1.1&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/code&gt;<br/>
<br/>
and the resolve I am using is:<br/>
&lt;code type=&quot;xml&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;resolvers&gt;<br/>
    &lt;ivyrep name=&quot;ivyrep&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/resolvers&gt;<br/>
&lt;/code&gt;<br/>
<br/>
But I get the following when I try to resolve:<br/>
[ivy:resolve] [FAILED     ] [ apache | commons-logging | 1.1 ]/commons-logging.jar[jar] : invalid sha1 (3553ms)<br/>
<br/>
What is odd, is that if I go to http://www.ibiblio.org/maven/commons-logging/jars/ there is no sha1 hash, only an md5 (although maybe just the message is wrong, and it is actually checking the md5 hash).<br/>
<br/>
However, in 1.3.1 of IVY it&#39;s all find (because there is no checking).<br/>
<br/>
The interim solution to this problem was to use 1.3.1 of ivy to download commons-logging 1.1. so it is in my cache, and then switch back to 1.4...
  </td>
