  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I am trying to publish to filesystem some artifacts from IBM (could be from any vendor).<br/>
<br/>
I get these type of messages :<br/>
<br/>
[ivy:publish] missing artifact [ ibm | websphere | 5.1 ]/jmxc.jar.jar[jar]: C:\IBM51\WebSphere\AppServer\lib\jmxc.jar.jar file does not exist<br/>
<br/>
You notice .jar.jar at the end of the path which is weird.<br/>
<br/>
With Ivy 1.3.1 this problem does not exist.<br/>
<br/>
I will attach my build files and config files to the bug report. You can create any phony files to replace the vendor jars.<br/>
<br/>
Regards,<br/>
<br/>
Antoine
