                <tr id="issuerow12356915" rel="12356915" data-issuekey="IVY-308" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-308" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-308">IVY-308</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ressuscitate &#39;id&#39; in IvyCachePath and deprecate pathid
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stephane Bailliez
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stephane Bailliez
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Sep/06 18:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Oct/06 16:47 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      please do not remove any method like this without an interim release.<br/>
<br/>
My 1.3.1 build was using &#39;id&#39; and by just dropping the 1.4RC1 it blew up instantly.<br/>
<br/>
No one could even guess that it was deprecated as it is only using @deprecated.<br/>
Common practice in Ant is to log an annoying message in CAPITAL and WARN mode saying that IT IS DEPRECATED and you should use something else.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
