                <tr id="issuerow12356921" rel="12356921" data-issuekey="IVY-314" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-314" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-314">IVY-314</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Resolve alway set ivy.deps.changed to either true or false while doc claims it only does when it is changed
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stephane Bailliez
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stephane Bailliez
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Oct/06 08:38 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Oct/06 16:49 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:05 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
http://www.jayasoft.org/ivy/doc/use/resolve<br/>
&quot;An additional property is set only if there are changes since the last resolve: ivy.deps.changed (since 1.2)&quot;<br/>
<br/>
Unfortunately it is not the case. The property is set all the time to either true or false, which is fundamentally different as it prevents this property to be used for Ant&#39;s if/unless. Workaround being to provide another indirection via a condition/equals.<br/>
<br/>
So either the doc has to be fixed to match the implementation or the other way around.<br/>
If you want to keep backward compatibility, that would be the docs.
  </td>
