                <tr id="issuerow12356935" rel="12356935" data-issuekey="IVY-328" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-328" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-328">IVY-328</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Install 3rd party modules from scratch into a publishable repository
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Oct/06 12:54 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Feb/08 11:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I would like to have the ability to install 3rd party jars into a repository from scratch. This means the 3rd party jar isn&#39;t in any kind of repository yet, so I can&#39;t use the ivy:install task for just copying it around. Let&#39;s assume I have written an ivy.xml for this dependency and I have all needed artifacts matching this ivy.xml. Now I would like to have a task to tell ivy, to publish this ivy.xml with the corresponding artifacts into one of my repositories. This task should accept all repositories that allow publishing, should have the choice to overwrite existing entries and should, of course, follow the given resolver patterns. Of course I could copy the files to the repository using scp or something, but this way I could write an ant task to do this and every developer of the project could do it then easily. AFAIK maven has this functionality and I think it would be good to reach the same level of usability.
  </td>
