                <tr id="issuerow12356936" rel="12356936" data-issuekey="IVY-329" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-329" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-329">IVY-329</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Retrieve transitive dependencies of a module into another repository (eg. from a remote to a locale repository to prepare offline mode)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Oct/06 13:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Feb/08 11:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I would like to have the ability to copy all dependencies of my project from one repository to another one (yes, not the artifact but its dependencies). The idea behind this is to let the user prepare to go offline, copying all needed dependencies from the internet or enterprise repository to a local repository on his hard disk. After that step I basically would like to have a fully working build process just using a subset of repositories. I am currently simulating this task by using ivy:report, parsing the report for all dependencies and using ivy:install to copy them from the intranet/enterprise repository to the local repository. Pretty awkward, but it works...This way people can use the full build process from inside eg. the train on their way home without the need to remember that they can&#39;t do resolving or something that needs internet access.<br/>
<br/>
See: http://www.jayasoft.org/node/862 that discusses the feature
  </td>
