                <tr id="issuerow12356937" rel="12356937" data-issuekey="IVY-330" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-330" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-330">IVY-330</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Enable HTTP(S) Authentication Credentials per Resolver or URL
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Oct/06 13:10 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Oct/06 16:27 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Nov/06 07:06 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      It should be possible to attach http authentication credentials (at least username/password) to any URL used as a resolver. Currently the only way to feed Ivy with HTTP authentication credentials is to use ivy:configure. This is especially annoying, if you have different resolvers in different realms. The current workaround is to call ivy:configure several times to pump in the different credentials into the Ivy&#39;s global Credential Store.<br/>
<br/>
Some more tags at the URL resolver should do the trick to sort this out.<br/>

  </td>
