                <tr id="issuerow12356941" rel="12356941" data-issuekey="IVY-334" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-334" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-334">IVY-334</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add extension for path- and fileset-types to ivy
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Nicolas Lalevée
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Oct/06 18:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Nov/10 18:15 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Nov/10 18:15 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.3.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As discussed in some other JIRA issue, it would be a good idea (if technically possible) to add path- en fileset extensions.<br/>
<br/>
A simple example which would be possible with this:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;classpath&gt;<br/>
      &lt;ivypath file=&quot;ivy.xml&quot; conf=&quot;compile&quot; /&gt;<br/>
      &lt;pathelement location=&quot;lib/helper.jar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/classpath&gt;<br/>
<br/>
regards,<br/>
Maarten
  </td>
