                <tr id="issuerow12356942" rel="12356942" data-issuekey="IVY-335" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-335" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-335">IVY-335</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ant project properties should be set after configure
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Gabriele Garuglieri
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Gabriele Garuglieri
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Oct/06 13:23 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Feb/08 11:45 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Current ivy behaviour is to set ant project properties with default values read from jar before configure is executed.<br/>
If ivyconf.xml refers to other properties with same name, their values are replaced for ivy, but ant project properties go out of sync because they still contain default values.<br/>
Ivy properties and ant project properties should be kept in sync with the following procedure:<br/>
<br/>
1-load the default ivy properties from ivy jar and set internal properties.<br/>
2-load ivyconf declared properties and replace internal properties with those values<br/>
3-process ivyconf<br/>
4-set ant project properties with content of ivy properties after configure
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
