                <tr id="issuerow12356943" rel="12356943" data-issuekey="IVY-336" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-336" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-336">IVY-336</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Comments in ivy.xml duplicated
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Williams
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            John Williams
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Nov/06 16:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Apr/07 07:47 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/Jan/07 11:22 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    17/Nov/06
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      java version &quot;1.5.0_08&quot;<br/>
Java(TM) 2 Runtime Environment, Standard Edition (build 1.5.0_08-b03)<br/>
Java HotSpot(TM) Client VM (build 1.5.0_08-b03, mixed mode, sharing)<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I publish an Ivy module, comments in the ivy.xml file that are outside the &lt;ivy-module&gt; element get duplicated. For example, this<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;utf-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;!-- crazy --&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;!-- normal --&gt;<br/>
  &lt;info organisation=&quot;foo&quot; module=&quot;bar&quot; revision=&quot;1.0&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>
<br/>
becomes this<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;utf-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;!-- crazy --&gt;<br/>
&lt;!-- crazy --&gt;&lt;!-- crazy --&gt;&lt;!-- crazy --&gt;&lt;ivy-module version=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;!-- normal --&gt;<br/>
  &lt;info organisation=&quot;foo&quot; module=&quot;bar&quot; revision=&quot;1.0&quot; status=&quot;milestone&quot; publication=&quot;20061106134429&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>

  </td>
