    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-347" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-347">IVY-347</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                &lt;include&gt; of configurations is incompatible with &lt;buildlist&gt; as paths are resolved relative to the base project
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
