                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I can&#39;t use the ability to include configurations, even though a shared set of standard configurations is essential.<br/>
<br/>
why not? Because although I can include a relative configuration, which works from a simple ivy:resolve, when a build file in a parent directory runs a &lt;buildlist&gt; task, the path resolution takes place from this parent project.<br/>
<br/>
Paths for inclusion must be relative to the ivy.xml file. Marked as critical :)
