                <tr id="issuerow12357982" rel="12357982" data-issuekey="IVY-350" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-350" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-350">IVY-350</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Urlresolver is not possible to use dynamic revisions on nonstandard repository structure
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Pierre Hägnestrand
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Pierre Hägnestrand
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Dec/06 07:48 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Apr/07 07:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/Jan/07 12:12 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Tested on both windows and linux
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      It is not possible to resolve a dependency that are declared dynamicly, eg. latest or region of revsions etc. <br/>
Example: &lt;dependency org=&quot;apache&quot; name=&quot;oro&quot; rev=&quot;2.0.+&quot; conf=&quot;default,oro-&gt;default&quot;/&gt;<br/>
It only fails when having a nonstandard structure of the repository and using http (works on file)<br/>
<br/>
&lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${rep.url}/[module]/[module]-[revision]/[type]s/[artifact].[type]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy pattern=&quot;${rep.url}/[module]/[module]-[revision]/ivy.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
We have fixed the code in fr.jayasoft.ivy.resolver.ResolverHelper and I will try to attach the code to this bugreport<br/>

  </td>
