</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Any
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      There is a VERY useful resolver that is not immediately available to people. We<br/>
have to do a typedef to get our hands on it,<br/>
<br/>
&lt;typedef name=&quot;cache&quot;<br/>
classname=&quot;fr.jayasoft.ivy.resolver.CacheResolver&quot;/&gt;.<br/>
<br/>
Its also not documented at all.<br/>
<br/>
Please enable this resolver by default (much like the filesystemresolver, urlresolver, etc).<br/>
Documentation would be wonderful too.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks
  </td>
