                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-538                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Please add a property to allow a user to set the default value of useOrigin.<br/>
This is useful as this often has to be repeated many times when you want<br/>
the value to be true for everything. <br/>
<br/>
The most common use case for my builds - I can&#39;t speak for others, is 1 resolve<br/>
and 3 cachepaths. On all of these I need to set useOrigin=true, which is 4 times.<br/>
If I could have set a property in my ivyconfig.xml once it would be much more <br/>
convienent. 
  </td>
