                                            <td class="description">      StatusManager has comments which are not reflecting the implementation.<br/>
<br/>
addStatus could be called as well after creating it with the non-bean ctor, it would make it as useless as the map is already precomputed.<br/>
<br/>
There are subtleties in this class that needs to be eliminated or make more clear.<br/>
It either need to be simplified and/or needs to fail on update methods when the maps have already been precomputed.<br/>

