                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Looking at StatusManager and XmlIvyConfigurationParser.<br/>
<br/>
It is unclear whether or not a null default status is valid.<br/>
The SAX code goes the extra step not to put null, yet the StatusManager deals with null by automatically setting the last element of the statuses (why is that ? so that means that order is relevant ? what&#39;s the rationale ? )<br/>
<br/>
Failing on null and checking that the default status is actually really on the provided list of statuses would be my preference.
