                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      build file:<br/>
<br/>
The practice of running javac with includeantruntime set to the default value (which is set to true for unfortunate legacy reasons) is not appropriate.<br/>
It would be better to explicitely declare ant and junit in the dependencies for compile and test and pick them the same way as other dependencies.<br/>
<br/>

