</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently if I want to create a fileset based on an ivy configuration *and* use the original repository instead of the cache, I have to create an ivy cachepath first, then convert it into a fileset.<br/>
<br/>
If the cachefileset task supported useOrigin then I would not need to do this.<br/>

