</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      all
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The &lt;ivy:resolve&gt; task creates very long output sometimes.  It would be nice to suppress this output (unless ant is run in verbose) mode.  It would also be helpful if there were an option to sort the list of modules by organization and name instead of just listing them as they are resolved; this would make it much easier to scan the output to determine which version of a particular module is in use.
  </td>
