                <tr id="issuerow12360235" rel="12360235" data-issuekey="IVY-383" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-383" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-383">IVY-383</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                LatestRevisionStrategy has split personality
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            John Williams
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            John Williams
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Jan/07 22:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Apr/07 07:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 23/Feb/07 09:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      all
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      LatestRevisionStrategy seems to compare both revision numbers and revision number patterns, but the implementation of patterns broken.  For instance, patterns like &quot;1.0+&quot; are treated specially, but patterns like &quot;[1.0,)&quot; are treated like literal revision numbers!  I have a case in which this causes conflict resolution to produce incorrect results.  I&#39;ll hopefully be posting a patch soon to fix the particular resolution problem I&#39;ve found, but I&#39;m suspicious that there are other cases in which patterns are erroneously passed to LatestRevisionStrategy.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
