                <tr id="issuerow12362389" rel="12362389" data-issuekey="IVY-404" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-404" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-404">IVY-404</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Static revision replacement is not working when delivering an artifact with a dependency on a branch
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Barrett Snyder
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Barrett Snyder
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Feb/07 00:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Jun/07 12:47 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 02/Mar/07 10:44 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        1.4.2,                     2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant,                     Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-433                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In trying to deliver an ivy.xml, using the ant &lt;deliver&gt; task, for an artifact which has a dependency on a &quot;latest.release&quot; revision of a specific branch the dynamic revision is not getting replaced with the static rev. Here is what the dependency looks like:<br/>
&lt;dependency name=&quot;my-framework&quot; rev=&quot;latest.release&quot; branch=&quot;fix_for_release&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
If I remove the branch indicator the latest HEAD revision gets used and the rev attribute gets updated correctly. If I add the branch attribute the correct dependent branch release jar gets used, but the dynamic revision of the published ivy stays &quot;latest.release&quot;.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
