                <tr id="issuerow12363545" rel="12363545" data-issuekey="IVY-408" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-408" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-408">IVY-408</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Publish extra info attributes in reports
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Stephen Nesbitt
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stephen Nesbitt
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stephen Nesbitt
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Feb/07 00:06 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 15/Mar/07 22:14 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                                        IVY-446                        </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Linux
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      While Ivy 1.4.1 supports additional attributes on the info element, those attributes are not printed in the reports. Update XmlReportOutput.java to output extra attributes. Also update xslt processor to display such attributes.<br/>
<br/>
The code changes appear very minor. I plan to submit a patch within the next 2 weeks.
