                <tr id="issuerow12364370" rel="12364370" data-issuekey="IVY-418" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-418" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-418">IVY-418</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy doesn&#39;t recognize maven2 classifiers
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Mar/07 18:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Apr/07 07:47 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Mar/07 21:11 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Maven2 allows to define a classifier when declaring a dependency. For instance:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;dependency&gt;<br/>
  &lt;groupId&gt;org.safehaus.jug&lt;/groupId&gt;<br/>
  &lt;artifactId&gt;jug&lt;/artifactId&gt;<br/>
  &lt;version&gt;2.0.0&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
  &lt;classifier&gt;asl&lt;/classifier&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
In this case the artifact which should be downloaded is:<br/>
http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/safehaus/jug/jug/2.0.0/jug-2.0.0-asl.jar<br/>
<br/>
As one can see, the classifier is appended after the revision. For the moment doesn&#39;t support this notion and fails, trying to download http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/safehaus/jug/jug/2.0.0/jug-2.0.0.jar
  </td>
