                <tr id="issuerow12364388" rel="12364388" data-issuekey="IVY-419" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-419" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-419">IVY-419</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                define artifacts not declared by the dependency module descriptor
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Mar/07 20:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Apr/07 07:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 07/Mar/07 21:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When you don&#39;t control your dependency module descriptor (using a public repo for example) it happens that you want more control over the dependency.<br/>
<br/>
For the moment, it&#39;s possible to define artifacts for the dependency only if the dependency has no module descriptor. What would be interesting would be to be able to declare such artifacts even when the dependency has a module descriptor. To be sure this is what is requested by the user, a boolean attribute would be use on the dependency artifact declaration:<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
&lt;dependency org=&quot;foo&quot; name=&quot;bar&quot; rev=&quot;1.0&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;artifact name=&quot;baz&quot; type=&quot;source&quot; ext=&quot;jar&quot; assumePublished=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
This feature would also help implement maven2 classifiers (see IVY-418)
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
