                                            <td class="environment">      W2K, jdk1.5.0_08
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I use the build-a-ivy-repository example to get org.apache.shale/shale-tiger-1.1.0-SNAPHOT I get:<br/>
[ivy:install] :: installing [ org.apache.shale | shale-tiger | 1.1.0-SNAPSHOT ] ::<br/>
[ivy:install] :: resolving dependencies ::<br/>
[ivy:install]   people-apache-maven2: found md file for [ org.apache.shale | shale-tiger | 1.1.0-SNAPSHOT ]<br/>
[ivy:install]           =&gt; http://people.apache.org/maven-snapshot-repository/org/apache/shale/shale-tiger/1.1.0-SNAPSHOT/shale-tiger-1.1.0-SNAPSHOT.pom (1.1.0-SNAPSHOT)<br/>
[ivy:install]   people-apache-maven2: downloading http://people.apache.org/maven-snapshot-repository/org/apache/shale/shale-tiger/1.1.0-SNAPSHOT/shale-tiger-1.1.0-SNAPSHOT.pom<br/>
[ivy:install]   people-apache-maven2: downloading http://people.apache.org/maven-snapshot-repository/org/apache/shale/shale-tiger/1.1.0-SNAPSHOT/shale-tiger-1.1.0-SNAPSHOT.pom.sha1<br/>
[ivy:install] sha1 OK for http://people.apache.org/maven-snapshot-repository/org/apache/shale/shale-tiger/1.1.0-SNAPSHOT/shale-tiger-1.1.0-SNAPSHOT.pom<br/>
[ivy:install] problem occured while resolving dependency: [ org.apache.shale | shale-tiger | 1.1.0-SNAPSHOT ] {default=[*]} with people-apache-maven2: java.text.ParseException: no groupId found in pom in file:/C:/WINNT/TEMP/ivy61323xml
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
