                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-460                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Setting m2compatible=&quot;true&quot; on an ibiblio resolver overwrites the root and pattern settings, even if they were set manually. Depending on the order of attributes and the xml parser used, the result is varying (if setM2compatible is called before setRoot, the configured root will be used, otherwise it&#39;s the default value for m2compatible which will be used!
