                <tr id="issuerow12365449" rel="12365449" data-issuekey="IVY-442" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-442" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-442">IVY-442</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy should fail where dependency uses undefined configuration
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            easyproglife
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            easyproglife
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 21/Mar/07 11:22 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Apr/07 07:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/Mar/07 22:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you specify an undefined configuration in dependency element conf attribue, ivy just continues silently.<br/>
<br/>
It takes long time on medium and large projects to identify the problem: the module is missing from the expected classpath.<br/>
<br/>
The correct behavior should be ivy failure or at least a warning message.
  </td>
