                <tr id="issuerow12365925" rel="12365925" data-issuekey="IVY-450" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-450" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-450">IVY-450</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Highlight current menu
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Gilles Scokart
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Gilles Scokart
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Mar/07 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Mar/07 19:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Documentation            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When you are on a page, it would be nice to somehow highlight the title of the current page in the left menu.  It can be a different style, font, color, background, whatever (my sens of the esthetic is rather limited).<br/>
