                <tr id="issuerow12366366" rel="12366366" data-issuekey="IVY-461" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-461" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-461">IVY-461</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                IvyPostResolve Task unnecessarily performs a resolve
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 01/Apr/07 21:23 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Jun/08 09:56 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you call an IvyPostResolve Task more than once with different configurations, a resolve is performed from the second post-resolve task.<br/>
<br/>
For instance:<br/>
&lt;ivy:resolve conf=&quot;compile&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:post-resolve conf=&quot;default&quot; /&gt;  --&gt; triggers a resolve of the &#39;default&#39; conf. OK!<br/>
&lt;ivy:post-resolve conf=&quot;compile&quot; /&gt;  --&gt; triggers a resolve of the &#39;compile&#39; conf. NOK!<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
