                                            <td class="description">      Currently URLResolver has URLRepository hard-coded, which in<br/>
turn has the ApacheUrlLister hard-coded, which can only handle the directory listing formats from a certain set of http servers, but not any of them - in my case, it&#39;s not able to recognize either maven-proxy or proximity listings.<br/>
<br/>
It&#39;d be nice to support URLLister plugins in settings.
