                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      For the moment artifact downloading during dependencies resolution happens sequentially, each artifact being downloaded one after the other.<br/>
<br/>
It would be nice to improve Ivy resolve engine to be able to parallelize downloading to optimize performance, especially when using a set of repositories with heterogeneous performance.<br/>
<br/>
We should see how load balancing feature of IVY-468 could be leveraged by this new downloading strategy.
  </td>
