</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ivy 1.5.0-incubating-dev-20070308022022 - 20070308022022
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      If I use defaultConflictManager=&quot;strict&quot;<br/>
<br/>
I get this<br/>
[ extern | commons-logging | 1.1 ] (needed by [[ extern | spring-framework | 2.0.2 ], [ ubs | laredo | working@whou0128628 ]])<br/>
conflicts with [ extern | commons-logging | [1.0.4,) ] (needed by [[extern | hibernate | 3.2.1 ]])<br/>
<br/>
It looks like the strict ConflictManager does not support dynamic ranges. 1.1 != [1.0.4,)  One package is requesting 1.1, the other is asking for 1.0.4 or greater. 
  </td>
