                <tr id="issuerow12367958" rel="12367958" data-issuekey="IVY-478" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-478" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-478">IVY-478</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                build fails without emma code coverage JARs present
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jeffrey Blattman
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jeffrey Blattman
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Apr/07 16:55 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 08/May/07 22:18 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 08/May/07 22:18 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      jdk 1.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      &gt; BUILD FAILED<br/>
&gt; /Users/jtb/src/dependencies/init-ivy.xml:46: The following error occurred<br/>
&gt; while executing this line:<br/>
&gt; jar:file:/Users/jtb/.ivy/jars/ivy.jar!/fr/jayasoft/ivy/ant/antlib.xml:21:<br/>
&gt; taskdef A class needed by class org.apache.ivy.ant.IvyConfigure cannot be<br/>
&gt; found: com/vladium/emma/rt/RT<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
OK, I think I know where the problem comes from. In our build when we use<br/>
emma to instrument classes we instrument classes in place. Usually this is<br/>
not a problem because the jar which is published is packaged before this<br/>
intrumentation... but if you run a first build with instrumentation, and<br/>
then run a second build without cleaning, the jar produced by the second<br/>
build will contain instrumented classes, which of course are not meant to be<br/>
actually used.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
