                <tr id="issuerow12368191" rel="12368191" data-issuekey="IVY-486" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-486" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-486">IVY-486</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Credentials are shown in build log even if debug is not enabled
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Pavel Sher
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Pavel Sher
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 27/Apr/07 10:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/07 18:03 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Apr/07 18:03 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have the following construction in my Ant build.xml:<br/>
    &lt;ivy-configure file=&quot;${basedir}/ivyconf.xml&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;credentials host=&quot;host&quot; realm=&quot;realm&quot; username=&quot;user&quot; passwd=&quot;pass&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/ivy-configure&gt;<br/>
<br/>
When Ant starts this build.xml I see in the output: <br/>
credentials added realm@host user/pass<br/>
<br/>
This output is produced by CredentialsStore class even if debug level is not enabled. As I can see the problem is that Messages.init is called after the adding of credentials and this message goes right to the system error and then it is printed by Ant itself. The problem is critical for me because I want to use this build.xml in the continuous integration server and I do not want my credentials to be shown in the build log. Is there a workaround for this?
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="27/Apr/07 12:10"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2007-04-27T12:10:26+0000">27/Apr/07 12:10 PM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312520"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312323"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312521">    10 years, 11 weeks, 6 days ago

                        </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312320"></td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310420">      140192
  </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312321"></td>
