                <tr id="issuerow12368283" rel="12368283" data-issuekey="IVY-489" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-489" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-489">IVY-489</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Post-Resolve task shouldn&#39;t set the &#39;resolveid&#39;
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Stephane Bailliez
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Stephane Bailliez
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Apr/07 10:59 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 30/Apr/07 23:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Apr/07 23:07 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I was testing our whole build system and it fails strangely into artifactreport (I&#39;m generating an artifactreport in the cache for further reuse only if the dependencies have changed) and the error message was &#39;ModuleDescriptor for resolve with id &#39;xxxxxxxx&#39; not found.&#39;<br/>
<br/>
Debugging in the task I found the resolveid issue (see the 2 other bugs open elsewhere).<br/>
The post resolve tasks do create a resolveid if this is not set by [organization]-[module], however I cannot see any evidence of that in the &#39;Resolve&#39; task.<br/>
<br/>
Not sure exactly what is supposed to be the behavior.<br/>

  </td>
