                                            <td class="environment">      jdk 1.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      ivy cannot resolve maven2 &quot;snapshot&quot; versioning. i am actually unclear whether there is some way to configure this to work, but the expectations is that if one sets m2compatible=&quot;true&quot; for the resolver, that the m2 snapshot versioning should just work without any other tweaks.<br/>
<br/>
i&#39;d be glad to make this a lower priority than blocker if someone can explain the manual configuration to make it work (i couldn&#39;t figure it out from the docs). 
