                <tr id="issuerow12369192" rel="12369192" data-issuekey="IVY-503" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-503" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-503">IVY-503</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                repreport task not working with m2compatible repository
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jean-Baptiste Quenot
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jean-Baptiste Quenot
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/May/07 16:52 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Jun/17 00:03 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant,                     Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When running the repreport task on a m2compatible repository, Ivy is not able to find artifacts with an organization name containing dots, it is only looking at every file/directory at depth 1 in the repository.<br/>
<br/>
Example:<br/>
<br/>
This artifact is properly reported:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
    &lt;module organisation=&quot;opensymphony&quot; name=&quot;quartz&quot; resolver=&quot;default-chain&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;revision name=&quot;1.5.2&quot; status=&quot;release&quot; pubdate=&quot;20060518223108&quot; resolver=&quot;external&quot; artresolver=&quot;external&quot; homepage=&quot;http://www.opensymphony.com/quartz/&quot; downloaded=&quot;false&quot; searched=&quot;true&quot; default=&quot;false&quot; conf=&quot;compile, default&quot; position=&quot;100&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;caller organisation=&quot;caller&quot; name=&quot;all-caller&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifacts&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/artifacts&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/revision&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/module&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
All artifacts with organization starting with &quot;org.apache&quot; are not properly reported:<br/>
<br/>
{code:xml}<br/>
    &lt;module organisation=&quot;org&quot; name=&quot;apache&quot; resolver=&quot;default-chain&quot;&gt;<br/>
      &lt;revision name=&quot;latest.integration&quot; error=&quot;not found&quot; downloaded=&quot;false&quot; searched=&quot;false&quot; conf=&quot;&quot; position=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;caller organisation=&quot;caller&quot; name=&quot;all-caller&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifacts&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/artifacts&gt;<br/>
      &lt;/revision&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/module&gt;<br/>
{code}
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
