</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When you declare a dependency on a module using the dependency artifact construct, Ivy fails to resolve it if you specify also a module configuration. All our unit tests on this subject only test without module configurations, thus defaulting to *.<br/>
<br/>
Working example:<br/>
	    &lt;dependency org=&quot;apache&quot; name=&quot;slide&quot; rev=&quot;20050629.161100&quot; conf=&quot;*-&gt;*&quot;&gt;   <br/>
	      	&lt;artifact name=&quot;slide-webdavlib&quot; type=&quot;jar&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	    &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
Buggy example:<br/>
	    &lt;dependency org=&quot;apache&quot; name=&quot;slide&quot; rev=&quot;20050629.161100&quot; conf=&quot;webdav-&gt;default&quot;&gt;   <br/>
	      	&lt;artifact name=&quot;slide-webdavlib&quot; type=&quot;jar&quot;/&gt; <br/>
	    &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>

  </td>
