              |__2.0<br/>
                  |____ivy-2.0.jar<br/>
{code} <br/>
<br/>
when I use &lt;ivy:install /&gt;, it will get converted into <br/>
<br/>
{noformat} <br/>
 org.apache<br/>
         |__ivy<br/>
              |__2.0<br/>
                  |____ivy-2.0.jar<br/>
{noformat} <br/>
<br/>
and it causes  &lt;ivy:retrieve /&gt; not able to find the same jar in the new repository.
