                                            <td class="environment">      Any
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Eric:<br/>
<br/>
The ivyconf.xml classpath tag accepts file or url elements which seem capable of pointing to only a single classpath element, either a path or a jar. Can a full classpath be expressed?<br/>
<br/>
For instance, I would like to set an ant property called my.classpath and have it contain something like &quot;a.jar:b.jar:c.jar&quot;. I&#39;d like to use that property in my ivyconf.xml in a classpath element to set the classpath for resolver with complex dependencies<br/>
<br/>
Xavier:<br/>
<br/>
Sounds like a good idea, but this is not implemented yet. Open a jira issue.<br/>

  </td>
