                <tr id="issuerow12372361" rel="12372361" data-issuekey="IVY-537" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-537" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-537">IVY-537</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Eviction fails for libs not providing their ivy configuration and providing artifacts named different between lib versions
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Johannes Stamminger
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Johannes Stamminger
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Jun/07 16:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 05/Apr/08 08:26 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 05/Apr/08 08:09 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-539                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      With moduleA referencing libX-1.0 with:<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;dependency name=&quot;libX&quot; rev=&quot;1.0&quot; org=&quot;COTS&quot; conf=&quot;compile, <br/>
development, deployment&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact name=&quot;libX&quot; conf=&quot;compile&quot;/&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact name=&quot;LICENSE&quot; type=&quot;license&quot; ext=&quot;txt&quot; <br/>
conf=&quot;deployment&quot;/&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact name=&quot;libX&quot; type=&quot;source&quot; ext=&quot;src.jar&quot; <br/>
conf=&quot;development&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
and another module referencing same libX but in version 2.0 by way of:<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;dependency name=&quot;libX&quot; rev=&quot;2.0&quot; org=&quot;COTS&quot; conf=&quot;compile, <br/>
development, deployment&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact name=&quot;libX&quot; conf=&quot;compile&quot;/&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact name=&quot;libX&quot; type=&quot;license&quot; ext=&quot;jar.license&quot; <br/>
conf=&quot;deployment&quot;/&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact name=&quot;libX&quot; type=&quot;source&quot; ext=&quot;src.jar&quot; <br/>
conf=&quot;development&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
the eviction of libX-1.0 fails (note the different namings for the license <br/>
artifact).
  </td>
