                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-360                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      it would be very nice to be able to set a property that defines the default value for useOrigin, for example, ivy.useOrigin. it would default to false for backwards compatibility. in a use case where only a local (filesystem) repo is used, it is tedious to set useOrigin on every ivy:resolve task. in our case, we have a large project with 50 modules and over 50 calls to resolve.
