                <tr id="issuerow12372629" rel="12372629" data-issuekey="IVY-546" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-546" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-546">IVY-546</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                repreport: add detailed information
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Nascif Abousalh-Neto
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Nascif Abousalh-Neto
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Jun/07 19:50 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Feb/08 08:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1,                     2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant,                     Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently the &quot;repreport&quot; feature displays only the artifacts as nodes and their dependencies as arcs - but no information about versions or configurations. Version information in particular is quite important for enterprise repositories as it is important to track the versioned dependency subgraphs to find out projects that use incompatible versions. Something similar to what is already offered by the &quot;report&quot; task would be a good start.<br/>
<br/>
<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
