                <tr id="issuerow12372630" rel="12372630" data-issuekey="IVY-547" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-547" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-547">IVY-547</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                repreport: add repository filtering
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Nascif Abousalh-Neto
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Nascif Abousalh-Neto
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Jun/07 19:53 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/Feb/08 08:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1,                     2.0.0-alpha-1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant,                     Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently the &quot;repreport&quot; task will run against all repositories available in a configuration. But not only the source repository information is lost on the final report, it can generate a huge amount of data if one of the repositories is a public repository like ibiblio. <br/>
<br/>
It would be quite useful to be able to specify a target repository as an attribute or some other form of filtering.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
