                <tr id="issuerow12372631" rel="12372631" data-issuekey="IVY-548" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-548" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-548">IVY-548</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ant target &quot;clean&quot; on Ivy multi-project tutorial points to wrong cache directory.
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Nascif Abousalh-Neto
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Nascif Abousalh-Neto
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 28/Jun/07 19:57 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 09/Jul/07 14:34 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 09/Jul/07 14:34 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4.1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-alpha-2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the &quot;multi-project&quot; tutorial example, the Ant task clean is defined as follows:<br/>
&lt;target name=&quot;clean&quot; depends=&quot;clean-all&quot; description=&quot;clean tutorial: delete repository, ivy cache, and all projects&quot;&gt;<br/>
     &lt;delete dir=&quot;repository&quot;/&gt;<br/>
     &lt;delete dir=&quot;ivy-cache&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/target&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The last target doesn&#39;t do anything. The intention is to delete the user&#39;s cache, so it should be:<br/>
&lt;target name=&quot;clean&quot; depends=&quot;clean-all&quot; description=&quot;clean tutorial: delete repository, ivy cache, and all projects&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;delete dir=&quot;repository&quot;/&gt;<br/>
  &lt;delete dir=&quot;${user.home}/.ivy/cache&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/target&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Ideally though it should point to an Ivy defined Ant property that contains the location of the cache, as this value can be set in the Ivy configuration file.<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
