                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-541                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      setup:<br/>
libA with artifact X and Y<br/>
module1 depending on X of libA<br/>
module 2 depending on module1 and on libA completely (specified by &lt;dependency name=&quot;libA&quot;/&gt; in dependencies section)<br/>
<br/>
Only X of libA is resolved for module2 though I would have expected X and Y.<br/>
<br/>
Workaround: for module2 specify dependency with &lt;dependency name=&quot;libA&quot;&gt;&lt;artifact name=&quot;X&quot;/&gt;&lt;artifact name=&quot;Y&quot;/&gt;&lt;/dependency&gt;
  </td>
