laytag\displaytag\ivy-1.1.xml:5:8: cvc-complex-type.4: Attribute &#39;organisation&#39; must appear on eleme<br/>
nt &#39;info&#39;. in C:\workspace\myproject\ivyrep\displaytag\displaytag\ivy-1.1.xml<br/>
