                <tr id="issuerow12375428" rel="12375428" data-issuekey="IVY-588" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-588" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-588">IVY-588</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Support *(private) and *(public) in the confs parameter of the resolve
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Gilles Scokart
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Gilles Scokart
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Gilles Scokart
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Aug/07 14:52 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Aug/07 19:14 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 06/Aug/07 19:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-beta-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      &#39;*&#39; is already accepted and we support *(public) and *(private) at other place.  For uniformity, we should support it as parameter of the resolve (and post-resolve) tasks as well.<br/>
<br/>
This requirements has been raised by debuging the go-ivy example.  In this tutorial, we make an inline resolve of a pom which use &#39;*&#39; as default for the conf.  Using *(public) sounds a good aproach to fix the tutorial, but is not yet supported.
  </td>
