                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-584                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When we resolve inline and we ask to the configuration *, we end-up trying to resolve private configuration from the repository, which is something that doesn&#39;t make sense.  To avoid that, we should replace the * by *(public) when we have an inline resolve.<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
