</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-598" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-598">IVY-598</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ivy:info locks up
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Won&#39;t Fix
</td>
