                                            <td class="description">      I have made fixes to the hello ivy example from the start.html page. Mostly, this fixing spelling error and the like. I also included a new ivy report since the existing one uses ivyrep which is confusing.<br/>
<br/>
One thing that I would like to see included is a clearer distinction between resolving and retrieving. The ant target is called resolving but all it does is calling the retrieve task which at a glance looks like a bug. Maybe a link to a page explaining the Ivy life cycle would be useful here?
