                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When I run the chainedresolvers-project example the ivysettings.xml file is not picked up. Instead the default ivysettings.xml file is picked up from the jar-file and the build fails. The output of the build:<br/>
