                <tr id="issuerow12381563" rel="12381563" data-issuekey="IVY-635" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-635" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-635">IVY-635</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Attempt to download a file with &amp; in its name causes SAXParseException in Ivy
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Critical
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Pavel Sher
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Pavel Sher
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 31/Oct/07 15:32 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 13/Nov/07 21:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 13/Nov/07 21:07 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        1.4            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-beta-1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I&#39;ve created a file with name file&amp;_.txt and tried to download it by Ivy. I get the following exception:<br/>
<br/>
Caused by: java.text.ParseException: failed to parse report: C:\BuildAgent\work\.ivy\cache\org-bt79-default.xml: The reference to entity &quot;_&quot; must end with the &#39;;&#39; delimiter.<br/>
	at fr.jayasoft.ivy.xml.XmlReportParser.getArtifacts(XmlReportParser.java:150)<br/>
	at fr.jayasoft.ivy.xml.XmlReportParser.getArtifacts(XmlReportParser.java:141)<br/>
