<br/>
Deeper investigation revealed that Ivy stores incorrect xml files in its cache. In particular bug is in the method XmlModuleDescriptorWriter.write() - it does not do any XML escaping while producing XML file. Moreover it does not check that there are no characters that cannot appear in XML attributes, tags and so on.<br/>
