                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When Ivy is used on a server or for repository maintenance task, the memory footprint of some widely used objects such as ModuleRevisionId or DefaultDepenendencyDescriptor can become a problem.<br/>
<br/>
Reducing the memory footprint of these objects or trying to reuse them when possible (for ModuleRevisionId, which is immutable) could help make Ivy more suitable for this kind of tasks.
