                <tr id="issuerow12384789" rel="12384789" data-issuekey="IVY-676" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-676" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-676">IVY-676</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Ivy doesn&#39;t respect the order of the ivy patterns as defined in the settings
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 17/Dec/07 17:02 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 18/Dec/07 22:23 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 18/Dec/07 22:23 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I have a resolver which has multiple Ivy patterns:<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
        &lt;filesystem name=&quot;tcomp-repository&quot; checkmodified=&quot;true&quot; changingPattern=&quot;.*&quot;  local=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;!-- pattern for the dependencies file --&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;${tcomp.repository}/lcm/[module]/[module]-[revision]/lib/[module]-[revision].ivy&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;!-- pattern for the &#39;old-style&#39; dependencies files --&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;${tcomp.repository}/lcm/[module]/[module]-[revision]/lib/[module]-[revision].dependencies&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;!-- the artifact locations --&gt;                <br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${tcomp.repository}/lcm/[module]/[module]-[revision]/[type]/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${tcomp.repository}/lcm/[module]/[module]-[revision]/[type]/[artifact].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${tcomp.repository}/lcm/[module]/[module]-[revision]/lib/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${tcomp.repository}/lcm/[module]/[module]-[revision]/lib/[artifact].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;!-- source artifacts --&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${tcomp.repository}/lcm/[module]/[module]-[revision]/[type]/[artifact]-[revision]-src.[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/filesystem&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
When both files exists (for instance moduleX-1.0.ivy and moduleX-1.0.dependencies):<br/>
with Ivy 1.4, the first pattern that matched was chosen.  In most cases, this was [module]-[revision].ivy<br/>
with Ivy 2.0.0-beta1, it seems that the last matching pattern is chosen: [module]-[revision].dependencies<br/>
<br/>
This can cause problems if both files defines the dependencies differently. 
  </td>
