                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      All
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Can we get an XML schema(xsd) file for ivysettings.xml files like we <br/>
have for ivy.xml files?  I just spent 2 hours trying to debug a <br/>
problem I had with my ivysettings.xml file because I had property tags <br/>
inside my resolvers tag.  I moved them outside the resolvers tag and <br/>
everything works now.  I think an xsd file would have caught this?<br/>
<br/>

  </td>
