                                            <td class="description">      If you want to build Ivy, you&#39;ll need Ant 1.7. For instance, if you try it with an older version of Ant, you&#39;ll ge the following error.<br/>
I think we should try to downgrade this requirement to Ant 1.6.<br/>
<br/>
{code}<br/>
...<br/>
jar:<br/>
    [mkdir] Created dir: C:\Projects\ivy\build\artifact\jars<br/>
<br/>
BUILD FAILED<br/>
C:\Projects\ivy\build.xml:294: Class org.apache.tools.ant.filters.LineContains doesn&#39;t support the &quot;negate&quot; attribute.<br/>
{code}
