                <tr id="issuerow12385573" rel="12385573" data-issuekey="IVY-690" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-690" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-690">IVY-690</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                NullPointerException reported instead of error in ivy:cachepath
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Russel Winder
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Russel Winder
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 04/Jan/08 10:43 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 04/Feb/08 22:33 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 04/Feb/08 22:33 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">1</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ubuntu 7.10 Gutsy Gibbon; Java 1.6.0_03-b05; Ant 1.7.0; Ivy 2.0.0-beta1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Using the erroneous:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy:cachepath organisation=&quot;apache&quot; module=&quot;commons-lang&quot; revision=&quot;2.3&quot;  pathid=&quot;lib.path.id&quot; inline=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
leads to the error message:<br/>
<br/>
No ivy:settings found for the default reference &#39;ivy.instance&#39;.  A default instance will be used<br/>
no settings file found, using default...<br/>
[ivy:cachepath] :: Ivy 2.0.0-beta1 - 20071206070608 ::<br/>
http://ant.apache.org/ivy/ ::<br/>
:: loading settings :: url = jar:file:/home/users/russel/lib/Java/groovy/lib/ivy-2.0.0-beta1.jar!/org/apache/ivy/core/settings/ivysettings.xml<br/>
<br/>
BUILD FAILED<br/>
/home/Checkouts/SVK/Gant/local/gant/trunk/examples/ivy/build.xml:36:<br/>
impossible to resolve dependencies:<br/>
        java.lang.NullPointerException<br/>
<br/>
Correct the ivy:cachepath to:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy:cachepath organisation=&quot;commons-lang&quot; module=&quot;commons-lang&quot; revision=&quot;2.3&quot;  pathid=&quot;lib.path.id&quot; inline=&quot;true&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
and everything works as expected.  The error report here is that a message other than NullPointerException should be generated.<br/>

  </td>
