                <tr id="issuerow12385962" rel="12385962" data-issuekey="IVY-698" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-698" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-698">IVY-698</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Promote Published Artifact
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Victor Volle
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Victor Volle
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Jan/08 13:09 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 06/Feb/09 07:30 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">3</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Some people already have asked for a &quot;promotion&quot; feature on the mailing list (s. e.g. http://www.nabble.com/Status-promotion-td14251285.html and http://www.nabble.com/Changes-in-published-ivy.xml-file-td13803061.html).<br/>
<br/>
What I would need is the possibility to change status of an artifact that already has been published. So to change the status in a published ivy.xml file from e.g. integration to milestone.<br/>
<br/>
I know it would be possible to (1) patch the ivy.xml file or to (2) do a overwrite=&quot;true&quot;, but with<br/>
(1) I would really sidestep Ivy and with<br/>
(2) I might accidentially replace the artifact, and not only change the ivy.xml.
  </td>
