                                            <td class="description">      I have build the trunk of Ivy today in order to be used in IvyDE : svn revision 611768<br/>
And a resolve threw a NPE : <br/>
{noformat}<br/>
com.company#project;latest.development: java.lang.NullPointerException at org.apache.ivy.plugins.resolver.AbstractResourceResolver.findResource(AbstractResourceResolver.java:161)<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
With the command line, with ant, I still use Ivy1.4, and it works.
