</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As disscussed here : http://mail-archives.apache.org/mod_mbox/ant-dev/200801.mbox/%3c635a05060801160721w7fcd1declaa32803ad3cfbe8c@mail.gmail.com%3e<br/>
<br/>
In order to get the list of artifacts which are part of the dependencies of a module, it will be useful to have a function in the ResolveReport class to get the download reports without the ones from the evited modules.
  </td>
