                <tr id="issuerow12387973" rel="12387973" data-issuekey="IVY-719" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-719" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-719">IVY-719</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                SSH/SFTP Resolvers don&#39;t create default passwd files
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Andreas Sahlbach
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 06/Feb/08 14:08 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Jun/08 10:33 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core,                     Documentation            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Apache Ant version 1.7.0 compiled on November 30 2007<br/>
<br/>
java version &quot;1.6.0_04&quot;<br/>
Java(TM) SE Runtime Environment (build 1.6.0_04-b12)<br/>
Java HotSpot(TM) Client VM (build 10.0-b19, mixed mode)<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Using one of the above resolvers without setting a &quot;passfile&quot; attribute and using a keyfile that requires a password lets ivy pop up a nice dialog where you can enter the required password for the keyfile. This dialog does not contain a &quot;rememberMe&quot; checkbox. If I define a &quot;passfile&quot; attribute, I get a &quot;rememberMe&quot; checkbox and everything works fine. According to the documentation a default should be used (as it was the case in ivy &lt; 2.0.x). <br/>
<br/>
I dug into the source code and it looks like that the AbstractSshBasedResolver has a function called setSettings in which the default passfile is been set. It seems to me that this function is never called. Maybe because the AbstractSshBasedResolver does not implement the interface IvySettingsAware ? <br/>
<br/>
BTW: The documentation does not mention the possibility to set a &quot;passfile&quot; attribute. I did this because of the source code I&#39;ve found so maybe the docs should be updated, too.
  </td>
