                <tr id="issuerow12389458" rel="12389458" data-issuekey="IVY-745" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-745" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-745">IVY-745</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Unwanted eviction of dependencies when optional attributes  in dependency and info tags are in consistent 
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Vasco Lemoine
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Vasco Lemoine
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 25/Feb/08 08:34 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 26/Aug/08 10:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 26/Aug/08 10:01 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Fedora 7 (i386), Java 1.5.0_10, apache-ivy-2.0.0-beta1, Ant 1.6.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      I introduced a extra attribute which I am using for building of<br/>
submodules.<br/>
<br/>
foo-ivy.xml:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&#39;2.0&#39;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;info organisation=&#39;foo&#39; module=&#39;foo&#39; revision=&#39;1&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;configurations&gt;<br/>
    &lt;include file=&#39;${build_home}/etc/ivy/ivy-configurations.xml&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/configurations&gt;<br/>
  &lt;publications /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
    &lt;dependency org=&#39;bar&#39; name=&#39;bar&#39; rev=&#39;trunk&#39; submodule=&#39;bar&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>
<br/>
bar-ivy.xml:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&#39;2.0&#39;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;info organisation=&#39;bar&#39; module=&#39;bar&#39; revision=&#39;1&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;configurations&gt;<br/>
    &lt;include file=&#39;${build_home}/etc/ivy/ivy-configurations.xml&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/configurations&gt;<br/>
  &lt;publications /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency org=&#39;foobar&#39; name=&#39;foobar&#39; rev=&#39;1&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Because the submodule attribute was missing in the bar-ivy.xml &lt;info&gt;<br/>
tag. The foobar dependency gets evicted. I&#39;m not sure this is expected<br/>
behavior. If not it is probably a bug or at least the provided<br/>
information is not clear enough to troubleshoot. Of course the work<br/>
around is adding the extra attribute to the info tag:<br/>
     <br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&#39;2.0&#39;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;info organisation=&#39;bar&#39; module=&#39;bar&#39; revision=&#39;1&#39; submodule=&#39;bar&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;configurations&gt;<br/>
    &lt;include file=&#39;${build_home}/etc/ivy/ivy-configurations.xml&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/configurations&gt;<br/>
  &lt;publications /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency org=&#39;foobar&#39; name=&#39;foobar&#39; rev=&#39;1&#39; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;
  </td>
