                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Maven supports a dependencyManagement section in the parent pom which allows one to override versions of both, direct and transitive, dependencies. Ivy currently lacks such a support. A discussion about this issue can be found here: http://mail-archives.apache.org/mod_mbox/ant-ivy-user/200802.mbox/%3c20080226184625.7decc0cd@sbs173%3e<br/>

