    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-761" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-761">IVY-761</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                The m2 parser doesn&#39;t recognize sources and javadocs
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
