                <tr id="issuerow12390966" rel="12390966" data-issuekey="IVY-770" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-770" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-770">IVY-770</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                MakePom task handling of mulitple artifacts for Maven2
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Paul Wardrip
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Paul Wardrip
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 13/Mar/08 16:12 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 12/Aug/10 15:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 11/Aug/10 21:49 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.2.0            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">3</td>
                                            <td class="watches">2</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-736                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Maven2 won&#39;t create more than one uniquely named artifact for a project, unless you set the packaging to &quot;pom&quot;. Then you have a separate pom for each of the artifacts, referencing the project pom with a parent tag. They would get deployed like this:<br/>
<br/>
/myorg/mymodule/1.0/mymodule-1.0.pom<br/>
/myorg/artifact-core/1.0/artifact-core-1.0.pom<br/>
/myorg/artifact-core/1.0/artifact-core-1.0.jar<br/>
/myorg/artifact-util/1.0/artifact-util-1.0.pom<br/>
/myorg/artifact-util/1.0/artifact-util-1.0.jar<br/>
<br/>
Resolution: Change MakePom task to build separate poms when it detects multiple uniquely named artifacts.
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
