Ubuntu, Java 1.5.0, Ant 1.6.5
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Ant build script fails when multiple &lt;ivy:retrieve&gt; inline calls are being called after each other and separated by &lt;ivy:cleancache&gt; between each call. Calling multiple &lt;ivy:retrieve inline=&quot;true&quot; ...&gt; tasks without any &lt;ivy:cleancache&gt; in between does not make the build fail.<br/>
The error can be tested by patching the example project: multi-project.<br/>
<br/>
The error occurs using both Ivy 2.0.0-beta1 and 2.0.0-beta2.<br/>

