                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Maven since version 2.0.6 supports a mechanism for a pom to override the version constraint of a transitive dependency (dependency management is used for that). IVY-753 has been opened to make Ivy compatible with that, so to fix this we will need to introduce a new mechanism to Ivy, which would better be available to users using Ivy native format (ivy xml files). Supporting branch override too seems to be a natural fit for Ivy in this case.
  </td>
