                <tr id="issuerow12394136" rel="12394136" data-issuekey="IVY-797" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-797" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-797">IVY-797</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Filesystem repositories can not have () in the path
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jim Bonanno
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jim Bonanno
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 16/Apr/08 18:01 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 29/May/08 19:46 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/May/08 19:46 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Here is the situation we ran into.<br/>
<br/>
The filesystem resolver has the following patterns<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;${ivy.local.default.root}/${ivy.local.default.ivy.pattern}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${ivy.local.default.root}/${ivy.local.default.artifact.pattern}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    ivy.local.default.ivy.pattern is &quot;[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]<br/>
    ivy.local.default.artifact.pattern is &quot;[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot;<br/>
<br/>
and<br/>
   ivy.local.default.root is c:\downloads\Program Files (x86)\repo<br/>
<br/>
The substituteToken method in IvyPatternHelper was replacing the &quot;(x86)&quot;  token in the path with nothing, and therefore the filesystem resolver couldn&#39;t find the local repository.<br/>
<br/>
When the resolver tries to look in the local repository the (x86) was removed.<br/>
<br/>
Fix suggested on the mailing list was to allow escaping the ()
  </td>
