</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Looking to use the &quot;Extra attributes&quot; options in the &lt;module/&gt; tag in an ivy.xml file<br/>
<br/>
But instead of something like:<br/>
<br/>
	&lt;info organisation=&quot;myorg&quot;  colour=&quot;blue&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
it would be nice to have property expansions to fill out the attribute value. Like:<br/>
<br/>
	&lt;info organisation=&quot;myorg&quot;  colour=&quot;${my.colour}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
But the property ${my.colour} never gets expanded.
  </td>
