                                            <td class="description">      There are two settings for &#39;cache&#39; in ivy/src/java/org/apache/ivy/core/settings/typedef.properties:<br/>
{noformat}cache		= org.apache.ivy.plugins.resolver.CacheResolver<br/>
<br/>
cache		= org.apache.ivy.core.cache.DefaultRepositoryCacheManager<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
That is probably wrong (or at least not a good idea).<br/>
<br/>

