                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-297                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the IvyBuildList file, you compare the value passed for onMissingDescriptor to a set of constants using the &#39;==&#39; operator.  In Java, this will always return false unless you have the exact same instance (which is unlikely in this case :))  The code should use the .equals() method which will return true when strings are identical, even when they are not the same instance.
