                <tr id="issuerow12394971" rel="12394971" data-issuekey="IVY-811" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-811" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-811">IVY-811</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Maven scope defined in POM dependencyManagement section not honoured
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Rick Riemer
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Rick Riemer
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Apr/08 09:23 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 22/May/08 21:44 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 22/May/08 21:44 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">       * Windows XP SP2<br/>
 * Sun Java 6 SE 1.6.0_05<br/>
 * Apache Ant 1.7.0
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      When resolving dependencies from Maven POMs, Ivy seems to ignore the dependency scopes as defined in the dependencyManagement section. For example when our project imports the org.picocontainer#picocontainer;1.2 project, Ivy considers xpp3#xpp3 and xstream#xstream as normal dependencies, while picocontainer-parent only includes them on test scope.<br/>
<br/>
I will attach the picocontainer POMs and the generated Ivy file to show what happens.
  </td>
