                <tr id="issuerow12396416" rel="12396416" data-issuekey="IVY-819" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-819" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-819">IVY-819</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ArtifactProperty task needs location for use with multiple caches
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jonathan Doklovic
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jonathan Doklovic
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/May/08 14:21 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/May/08 14:21 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      If you define multiple caches, the artifactproperty task is rendered pretty useless since it&#39;s impossible to get a reference to the proper cache folder for a given artifact.<br/>
<br/>
My suggestion is to expose [location] as an acceptable pattern in the value and expand it to be the localFile location that&#39;s set in the ArtifactDownloadReport.  The one could just do:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;artifactproperty name=&quot;[module].[ext]&quot; value=&quot;[location]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
<br/>
- jonathan
  </td>
