</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      In the FAQ, the command propsed to configure proxy settings isnot correct.<br/>
<br/>
Indeed the documentation says that the system property used to configure the proxt user name is &quot;http.proxyUserName&quot; while the org.apache.ivy.util.url.HttpClientHandler actually uses &quot;http.proxyUser&quot;.
  </td>
