                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Feature request to add a new resolver, called the &quot;Packager Resolver&quot;, [described here|http://ivyroundup.googlecode.com/svn/wiki/files/packager.html].<br/>
<br/>
Patch is attached and also available [here|http://ivyroundup.googlecode.com/svn/wiki/files/packager-resolver.patch]. Patch contains binary test files, so to apply it you have to follow the [simple steps described here|http://code.google.com/p/ivyroundup/].<br/>

