                <tr id="issuerow12397852" rel="12397852" data-issuekey="IVY-830" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-830" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-830">IVY-830</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                ivy.dep.file property unavailable before first &lt;ivy:resolve&gt; call, despite &lt;ivy:settings&gt; being called
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Greg St.Onge
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Greg St.Onge
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 09/Jun/08 23:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Sep/08 21:39 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Sep/08 21:39 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Ant            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The following test script:<br/>
&lt;ivy:settings/&gt;<br/>
&lt;echo message=&quot;ivy.dep.file = ${ivy.dep.file}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:resolve/&gt;<br/>
&lt;echo message=&quot;ivy.dep.file = ${ivy.dep.file}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Produces this output:<br/>
[echo] ivy.dep.file = ${ivy.dep.file}<br/>
[ivy:resolve] :: Ivy 2.0.0-beta2-local-20080108025749 - 20080108025749 :: http://ant.apache.org/ivy/ ::<br/>
:: loading settings :: file = C:\svn\ARCH-TOOL\ivy\hss-ivysettings.xml<br/>
[ivy:resolve] :: resolving dependencies :: hss#ef.srv;working@EDW-DV-GStOnge<br/>
[ivy:resolve]   confs: [compile, war, schema, spec-pdf, spec-html, javadocs]<br/>
[ivy:resolve] :: resolution report :: resolve 172ms :: artifacts dl 0ms<br/>
[echo] ivy.dep.file = ivy.xml<br/>
<br/>
Interestingly, the deprecated &lt;ivy:configure&gt; works properly:<br/>
&lt;ivy:configure/&gt;<br/>
&lt;echo message=&quot;ivy.dep.file = ${ivy.dep.file}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:resolve/&gt;<br/>
&lt;echo message=&quot;ivy.dep.file = ${ivy.dep.file}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Produces output:<br/>
[ivy:configure] ivy:configure is deprecated, please use the data type ivy:settings instead<br/>
[echo] ivy.dep.file = ivy.xml<br/>
no settings file found, using default...<br/>
[ivy:resolve] :: Ivy 2.0.0-beta2-local-20080108025749 - 20080108025749 :: http://ant.apache.org/ivy/ ::<br/>
:: loading settings :: url = jar:file:/C:/svn/ARCH-TOOL/ivy/apache.ivy_2.0.0.beta2_20080108025749.jar!/org/apache/ivy/core/settings/ivysettings.xml<br/>
