                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Using the latest build from trunk, which supports sources, javadoc and distribution artifacts, wrong jars are downloaded from repo1.maven.org. <br/>
<br/>
In the case below only spring-oxm-tiger-1.5.2-sources.jar is downloaded, which is published as spring-oxm-1.5.2.jar (which should have been the &#39;standard&#39; jar containing classfiles.<br/>
<br/>
Sample output:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
[ivy:install] :: downloading artifacts to cache ::<br/>
