                <tr id="issuerow12398604" rel="12398604" data-issuekey="IVY-844" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-844" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-844">IVY-844</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add hook for setting RelativeUrlResolver implementation in IvySettings
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Arthur Branham
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Arthur Branham
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 19/Jun/08 17:38 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 03/Sep/08 22:00 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 03/Sep/08 22:00 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      IvySettings.getRelativeUrlResolver always returns a new NormalRelativeUrlResolver.  I would like to see a hook made available to set a custom implemenatation of the url resolver, whether it be setting a thread safe reusable instance or a factory to create a new instance for each use.<br/>
<br/>
My interest in this comes from the fact that ant properties are not expanded in dependency module descriptors.  I have module descriptors which import their configurations from a common location.  The path of that location will be OS specific based on where Ivy is running.  I would therefor need a custom relative url resolver which expands properties before constructing a URL object as done in the NormalRelativeUrlResolver.<br/>
<br/>
The following is possible right now, but would not work if running from windows.<br/>
&lt;configurations&gt;<br/>
&lt;include file=&quot;/repository/org/mod/rev/etc/ivyconfigurations.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/configurations&gt;<br/>
<br/>
An ideal fix for the problem would be:<br/>
&lt;configurations&gt;<br/>
&lt;include file=&quot;${repository}/org/mod/rev/etc/ivyconfigurations.xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/configurations&gt;
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
