                <tr id="issuerow12398675" rel="12398675" data-issuekey="IVY-846" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-846" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-846">IVY-846</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Undocumented &quot;keep&quot; attribute referenced in documentation
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            David Corley
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            David Corley
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 20/Jun/08 09:07 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 20/Jun/08 09:07 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Documentation            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP SP3, JDK 1.6.0_06, Ant 1.7.0
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      The following appears on the docs page on post-resolve tasks:<br/>
==================<br/>
All these tasks will trigger automatically a resolve if:<br/>
<br/>
    * none has already been called in the current build with the attribute keep set to true (see below)<br/>
<br/>
==================<br/>
<br/>
There is no mention of a &quot;keep&quot; attribute in the &lt;ivy:resolve&gt; doc page, so the documentation needs to be updated to reflect this new attribute.<br/>

