</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Please find the attached patch that includes my modest contribution:<br/>
<br/>
- Ivy files are now synonymously called &quot;module descriptors&quot; to better explain their purpose. (&quot;Descriptor&quot; is an established, more generic term that can be used also with e.g. Maven POMs.)<br/>
<br/>
- Elaborated dynamic and resolved ivy files documentation, including the deliver and publish tasks, and several cross-references.<br/>
<br/>
- Added an illustration to the publish task to show its relation with the deliver task.<br/>
<br/>
- Changed an old reference to &quot;configuration&quot; to &quot;settings&quot; instead as it should be.<br/>

