                <tr id="issuerow12399049" rel="12399049" data-issuekey="IVY-850" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-850" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-850">IVY-850</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Checksums can be defined in ivy.xml files
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Minor
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Paul Mackay
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Paul Mackay
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 26/Jun/08 00:00 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 16/Oct/09 18:43 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">3</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Ivy currently supports verifying files using separate checksum files present in the same location as the artifacts.  It would also be useful to support defining the checksum inline as an attribute of an artifact. For some users this could be a preferable way to store the checksum information. It is something we would find useful and one other person on the mailing list commented that it was a good idea. There were no negative comments. 
  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregateprogress">     
</td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimespent"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="aggregatetimeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="labels">    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12310220">            <span title="16/Oct/09 18:43"><time class="livestamp allow-future" datetime="2009-10-16T18:43:43+0000">16/Oct/09 6:43 PM</time></span>
    </td>
                                            <td class="customfield_12312322"></td>
