                <tr id="issuerow12399520" rel="12399520" data-issuekey="IVY-853" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-853" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-853">IVY-853</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Wrong message: overwrite == true (SSH, SFTP)
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Duplicate
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Michael Kebe
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Michael Kebe
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 03/Jul/08 08:30 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 25/Aug/08 22:17 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 25/Aug/08 22:17 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate">300</td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate">300</td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">            0%
    </td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-752                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP, Eclipse 3.3 integrated Ant
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Although overwrite explicitly set overwrite to false:<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
&lt;ivy:publish resolver=&quot;foo-repo&quot; publishivy=&quot;true&quot; overwrite=&quot;false&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;artifacts pattern=&quot;dist/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy:publish&gt;<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
the message says:<br/>
<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
build.xml:171: impossible to publish artifacts for foo#bar;0.1: java.io.IOException: destination file exists and overwrite == true<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
<br/>
*The behaviour is correct!* Simply the message is wrong.<br/>
<br/>
The source code related to it:<br/>
<br/>
SshRepository.java:253-257<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
            if (!overwrite) {<br/>
                if (checkExistence(filePath, session)) {<br/>
                    throw new IOException(&quot;destination file exists and overwrite == true&quot;);<br/>
                }<br/>
            }<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
SFTPRepository.java:136-138<br/>
{noformat}<br/>
            if (!overwrite &amp;&amp; checkExistence(destination, c)) {<br/>
                throw new IOException(&quot;destination file exists and overwrite == true&quot;);<br/>
            }<br/>
{noformat}
  </td>
