                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      When in a macrodef one want to reference an existing resolver, Ivy complains about not finding the referenced resolver.<br/>
<br/>
Example:<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;resolvers&gt;<br/>
  &lt;ibiblio name=&quot;test&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/resolvers&gt;<br/>
&lt;macrodef name=&quot;mymacro&quot;&gt;<br/>
  &lt;chain name=&quot;c&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;resolver ref=&quot;test&quot; /&gt;<br/>
  &lt;/chain&gt;<br/>
&lt;/macrodef&gt;<br/>
{code}
  </td>
