                <tr id="issuerow12400020" rel="12400020" data-issuekey="IVY-862" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-862" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-862">IVY-862</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Detect missing artifacts on publish asap
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 10/Jul/08 13:44 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 10/Jul/08 14:21 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 10/Jul/08 14:21 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently when one use the publish task with haltonmissing = true, the publication is interrupted when a missing artifact is found, but others artifact may be published before, which is a problem for consistency with resolvers which do not support transactions.<br/>
<br/>
Therefore detecting such a problem before publishing any artifact would be better, at least when haltonmissing is true.
