                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Please apply the attached patch to:<br/>
* effectively rename old &quot;configuration&quot; directory to &quot;settings&quot; (keeping the old files in place, adding the new directory)<br/>
* replace all documentation pages in the old directory with HTML redirects to their new location under settings/<br/>
* replace several (probably all?) obsolete documentation references to &quot;configuration&quot; with the correct reference to &quot;settings&quot;<br/>
* update xooki table of contents respectively<br/>
* add common Eclipse and Windows files (.project, Thumbs.db) to svn ignore list<br/>
<br/>
There are well over 100 individual corrections made. Enjoy!
