                <tr id="issuerow12401877" rel="12401877" data-issuekey="IVY-879" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-879" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-879">IVY-879</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Using ivy in offline mode
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Closed
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Jean-Louis Boudart
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Jean-Louis Boudart
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 07/Aug/08 09:39 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/09 22:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 24/Jan/09 21:14 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">2</td>
                                            <td class="watches">6</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I recently tried to use ivy in offline, everything is in ivy-cache, but ivy seems to check dynamique revision all the time.<br/>
Exemple:  Suppose you have this dependency on your project<br/>
    &lt;dependency org=&quot;jasperreports&quot; name=&quot;jasperreports&quot; rev=&quot;2.0.5&quot; conf=&quot;runtime-&gt;runtime&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Looking in the POM file (http://repo1.maven.org/maven2/jasperreports/jasperreports/2.0.5/jasperreports-2.0.5.pom) we can see that jasperreports depends on commons-logging#[1.0,)<br/>
<br/>
This revision is evaluated on every resolve/retrieve. <br/>
I&#39;ve tried to tune my cache with a large TTL, but the problem is still here.<br/>
My cache configuration : <br/>
	&lt;caches default=&quot;mycache&quot; checkUpToDate=&quot;false&quot;&gt;<br/>
	  	&lt;cache name=&quot;mycache&quot; basedir=&quot;${ivy.home.dir}/ivy-cache&quot; defaultTTL=&quot;1d&quot;&gt;<br/>
	  		&lt;ttl revision=&quot;latest.integration&quot; duration=&quot;1d&quot; /&gt;<br/>
	  	&lt;/cache&gt;<br/>
	&lt;/caches&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Maybe there is a regression on my version?<br/>
<br/>
Even if the TTL options seems to be interessant, i&#39;m not so sure that this is the best solution for working in &quot;offline mode&quot;.<br/>
It could be a nice improvement to reuse the cache even if TTL is expired when repo are not reachable.<br/>
<br/>
What do you think about it?<br/>

  </td>
