                <tr id="issuerow12403425" rel="12403425" data-issuekey="IVY-889" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-889" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-889">IVY-889</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Trigger only fires for the first dependency when the event is post-download-artifact
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Invalid
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Xavier Hanin
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Steve Benigan
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Steve Benigan
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Aug/08 20:43 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 15/Sep/08 07:51 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 15/Sep/08 07:51 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0.0-beta-2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      OSX Leopard, Windows XP, JSE 1.5 and JSE 1.6, Ant 1.7.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      With an empty default cache directory I would expect the post-download-artifact to event to trigger for each artifact but it is only triggering for the first dependency listed in ivy.xml<br/>
<br/>
ivy.xml:<br/>
...<br/>
        &lt;dependency org=&quot;commons-lang&quot; name=&quot;commons-lang&quot; rev=&quot;1.0&quot; conf=&quot;&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency org=&quot;commons-cli&quot;  name=&quot;commons-cli&quot;  rev=&quot;1.0&quot;/&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
<br/>
ivysettings.xml:<br/>
... <br/>
   &lt;triggers&gt;<br/>
        &lt;ant-build<br/>
            antfile=&quot;${ivy.settings.dir}/build.xml&quot;<br/>
            target=&quot;test&quot;<br/>
            prefix=&quot;dep&quot;<br/>
            event=&quot;post-download-artifact&quot;<br/>
            filter=&quot;status=successful&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/triggers&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
<br/>
build.xml<br/>
...<br/>
    &lt;target name=&quot;build&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;ivy:resolve/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/target&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
    &lt;target name=&quot;test&quot;&gt;<br/>
        &lt;echo message=&quot;***** ${dep.organisation} ${dep.revision} ${dep.artifact} ${dep.ext}&quot;/&gt; <br/>
    &lt;/target&gt;<br/>
<br/>
Executing the build, only commons-lang artifact download (or whichever dependency is resolved first) results in a call to the test target.
  </td>
