                                            <td class="environment">      Windows XP Professional SP2, Sun JDK 1.5.17, 3Gb Ram, 8 Core Xeon processor.
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      After publishing with transactional=&quot;auto&quot;, the revisions directory in the jars directory has a name like &quot;1.0.part&quot;. The corresponding directory in the ivys directory has a correct name like &quot;1.0&quot;<br/>
<br/>
The Ivy settings file is:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivysettings&gt;<br/>
    &lt;property name=&quot;build.ivy.cache.dir&quot; value=&quot;ivy/cache&quot; override=&quot;false&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;property name=&quot;build.ivy.repo.url&quot; value=&quot;http://lonespappd0a.uk.db.com:8770/repo&quot; override=&quot;false&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;property name=&quot;build.ivy.resolver&quot; value=&quot;url-resolve&quot; override=&quot;false&quot;/&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;caches defaultCacheDir=&quot;${build.ivy.cache.dir}&quot; defaultResolver=&quot;${build.ivy.resolver}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;resolvers&gt;<br/>
        &lt;url name=&quot;url-resolve&quot; latest=&quot;latest-revision&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;${build.ivy.repo.url}/[organisation]/[module]/ivys/[module]-[revision].xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.ivy.repo.url}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.ivy.repo.url}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[artifact].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;${build.ivy.repo.url}/[organisation]/[module]/ivys/[revision]/[module]-[revision].xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.ivy.repo.url}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[revision]/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.ivy.repo.url}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[revision]/[artifact].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/url&gt;<br/>
        &lt;filesystem name=&quot;fs&quot; latest=&quot;latest-revision&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;${build.local.ivy.repository}/[organisation]/[module]/ivys/[module]-[revision].xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.local.ivy.repository}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.local.ivy.repository}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[artifact].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ivy pattern=&quot;${build.local.ivy.repository}/[organisation]/[module]/ivys/[revision]/[module]-[revision].xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.local.ivy.repository}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[revision]/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.local.ivy.repository}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[revision]/[artifact].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/filesystem&gt;<br/>
        &lt;filesystem name=&quot;fs1&quot; latest=&quot;latest-revision&quot; transactional=&quot;false&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;ivy      pattern=&quot;${build.local.ivy.repository}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[revision]/[module]-[revision].xml&quot; /&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifact pattern=&quot;${build.local.ivy.repository}/[organisation]/[module]/[type]s/[revision]/[artifact]-[revision].[ext]&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/filesystem&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/resolvers&gt;<br/>
    &lt;modules&gt;<br/>
        &lt;module organisation=&quot;.*&quot; name=&quot;.*&quot; resolver=&quot;${build.ivy.resolver}&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/modules&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivysettings&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The Ivy file is:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;?xml version=&quot;1.0&quot; encoding=&quot;UTF-8&quot;?&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&quot;1.3&quot; xmlns:xsi=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance&quot;<br/>
    xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=&quot;http://ant.apache.org/ivy/schemas/ivy.xsd&quot;&gt;<br/>
    &lt;info organisation=&quot;org&quot; module=&quot;module&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;publications&gt;<br/>
        &lt;artifact name=&quot;xyz&quot; type=&quot;jar&quot;/&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/publications&gt;<br/>
    &lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency org=&quot;checkstyle&quot; name=&quot;checkstyle&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency org=&quot;pmd&quot; name=&quot;pmd&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot; /&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency org=&quot;xxx&quot; name=&quot;all&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;include name=&quot;yyyy&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/dependency&gt;<br/>
        &lt;dependency org=&quot;xxx&quot; name=&quot;j2ee&quot; rev=&quot;latest.integration&quot; /&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The Ant target is like this:<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;target<br/>
        name=&quot;publish.to.ivy&quot;<br/>
        depends=&quot;init.ivy&quot;<br/>
        description=&quot;Publish the jar file to the Ivy repository&quot;&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;echoproperties prefix=&quot;ivy&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;property name=&quot;ivy.deliver.revision&quot; value=&quot;${ivy.new.revision}&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;ivy:publish<br/>
            resolver=&quot;fs1&quot;<br/>
            status=&quot;integration&quot;<br/>
            update=&quot;true&quot;&gt;<br/>
            &lt;artifacts pattern=&quot;${build.packages.dir}/[artifact].[ext]&quot;/&gt;<br/>
        &lt;/ivy:publish&gt;<br/>
    &lt;/target&gt;<br/>
<br/>
