</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment">      Ant 1.7.1
  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      ivy.cache.dir.${settingsRef} is not set properly after a call to resolve.<br/>
<br/>
e.g.<br/>
<br/>
ivysettings.xml<br/>
...<br/>
&lt;caches defaultCacheDir=&quot;someDirectory&quot;/&gt;<br/>
...<br/>
<br/>
build.xml<br/>
&lt;ivy:settings id=&quot;test&quot; file=&quot;ivysettings.xml&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;ivy:resolve settingsRef=&quot;test&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;echo message=&quot;Cache Dir : ${ivy.cache.dir.test}&quot;<br/>
<br/>
ivy.cache.dir.test is set to the default ${user.home}/.ivy2/cache instead of &quot;someDirectory&quot; that is the value of the defaultCacheDir attribute set in the ivysettings.xml.
  </td>
