                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-900                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The POM file here:<br/>
http://repository.jboss.com/maven2/org/jboss/cache/jbosscache-core/2.1.1.GA/jbosscache-core-2.1.1.GA.pom<br/>
<br/>
doesn&#39;t work with Ivy, since the version is specified as:<br/>
&lt;version&gt;${jbosscache-core-version}&lt;/version&gt;<br/>
<br/>
e.g. it uses a property in the POM. Ivy fails to set up properties until after the version has been parsed, and hence gets the version as ${jbosscache-core-version} rather than 2.1.1.GA.
  </td>
