                <tr id="issuerow12405052" rel="12405052" data-issuekey="IVY-917" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-917" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-917">IVY-917</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                overridingconfmappingoverride
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> New Feature</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Martin Eigenbrodt
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Martin Eigenbrodt
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Sep/08 06:29 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 24/Sep/08 06:29 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      As described in Ivy-916 confmappingoverride does not override.<br/>
I propose an attribute overridingconfmappingoverride (You may find a better name...) that really leads to overriding the confmapping.<br/>
Example:<br/>
{code}<br/>
&lt;configurations defaultconfmapping=&quot;conf1-&gt;other1;conf2-&gt;other2&quot;<br/>
overridingconfmappingoverride=&quot;true&quot;<br/>
&gt;<br/>
   &lt;conf name=&quot;conf1&quot; /&gt;<br/>
   &lt;conf name=&quot;conf2&quot; extends=&quot;conf1&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/configurations&gt;<br/>
&lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
   &lt;dependency name=&quot;other-module&quot; conf=&quot;conf1&quot; /&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
{code}<br/>
<br/>
should lead to the following mapping beeing constructed in memory<br/>
{code}&lt;dependency name=&quot;other-module&quot; conf=&quot;conf2-&gt;other2&quot; /&gt;{code}<br/>
as opposed to<br/>
{code}&lt;dependency name=&quot;other-module&quot; conf=&quot;conf1-&gt;other1;conf2-&gt;other2&quot; /&gt;{code}<br/>
with configmappingoverride=&quot;true&quot;
  </td>
