                <tr id="issuerow12405053" rel="12405053" data-issuekey="IVY-918" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-918" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-918">IVY-918</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                # does not work in defaultconfmapping for extenden configurations
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Martin Eigenbrodt
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Martin Eigenbrodt
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 24/Sep/08 06:46 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 27/Jun/12 06:01 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The &quot;this&quot; operator &quot;#&quot; does not work within defaultconfmapping. Consider the following example:<br/>
One would expect that<br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&quot;1.4&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;info organisation=&quot;me&quot; module=&quot;ivy-test&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;configurations<br/>
{color:red}   defaultconfmapping=&quot;default-&gt;#&quot;&gt; {color}<br/>
   &lt;conf name=&quot;default&quot; visibility=&quot;public&quot;/&gt;<br/>
   &lt;conf name=&quot;src&quot; visibility=&quot;private&quot; extends=&quot;*&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/configurations&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
   &lt;dependency org=&quot;jgoodies&quot; name=&quot;binding&quot; conf=&quot;default&quot; rev=&quot;2.0.4&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>
<br/>
is equivalent to <br/>
<br/>
&lt;ivy-module version=&quot;1.4&quot;&gt;<br/>
&lt;info organisation=&quot;me&quot; module=&quot;ivy-test&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;configurations&gt;<br/>
   &lt;conf name=&quot;default&quot; visibility=&quot;public&quot;/&gt;<br/>
   &lt;conf name=&quot;src&quot; visibility=&quot;private&quot; extends=&quot;*&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/configurations&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;dependencies&gt;<br/>
   &lt;dependency org=&quot;jgoodies&quot; name=&quot;binding&quot; {color:red} conf=&quot;default-&gt;#&quot; {color} rev=&quot;2.0.4&quot;/&gt;<br/>
&lt;/dependencies&gt;<br/>
&lt;/ivy-module&gt;<br/>
<br/>
But it&#39;s not. If you resolve the configuration src int the fist example you will recieve bindings in configuration default.<br/>
In the second you will recieve it in configuration src.<br/>

  </td>
                                            <td class="security"></td>
                                            <td class="progress">     
</td>
