                <tr id="issuerow12405463" rel="12405463" data-issuekey="IVY-926" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-926" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-926">IVY-926</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Maven Pom reader doesn&#39;t handle optional dependencies correctly in some instances
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Phil Messenger
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Phil Messenger
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 30/Sep/08 13:41 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 21/Oct/08 22:02 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 30/Sep/08 20:35 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.0-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Maven Compatibility            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">0</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      The &quot;isOptional&quot; function in org/apache/ivy/plugins/parser/m2/PomReader.java just checks for the existence of an element with the name &quot;optional&quot;. If this element is found, it returns &quot;true&quot; indicating that the dependency is optional.<br/>
<br/>
The actual value of the element is ignored, so a dependency with &quot;&lt;optional&gt;false&lt;/optional&gt;&quot;, is still taken to be an optional dependency.
  </td>
