                                            <td class="issuelinks">                                        IVY-1221                        </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Snapshot releases with static name like 1.2.3-SNAPSHOT are not updated into the cache.<br/>
<br/>
Same problem is with ivy and maven remote repos.<br/>
<br/>
Here ivy example:<br/>
<br/>
Remote ivy repo contains in ivy xml:<br/>
<br/>
status=&quot;integration&quot; publication=&quot;20081010104634&quot;<br/>
<br/>
