<br/>
[ivy-resolve] default: Checking cache for: dependency: org#&gt;module;1.2.3-SNAPSHOT {runtime=[runtime]}<br/>
[ivy-resolve] don&#39;t use cache for org#&gt;module;1.2.3-SNAPSHOT: changing=true<br/>
[ivy-resolve] local: Checking cache for: dependency: org#&gt;module;1.2.3-SNAPSHOT{runtime=[runtime]}<br/>
[ivy-resolve] local: module revision found in cache: org#&gt;module;1.2.3-SNAPSHOT<br/>
[ivy-resolve]   found org#&gt;module;1.2.3-SNAPSHOT in remote_ivy<br/>
...<br/>
[ivy-resolve] :: downloading artifacts ::<br/>
[ivy-resolve]   [NOT REQUIRED] org#&gt;module;1.2.3-SNAPSHOT!module.jar<br/>
