                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      <br/>
I&#39;m trying to test a simple namespace transformation using the install task.  I find that the transformation works when I assign a namespace to<br/>
any standard resolver.   But when I assign a namespace to a chain<br/>
resolver, the transformation does not occur (except for any namespace-enabled standard elements in the chain, these still work).<br/>
<br/>
The docs suggest that namespaces are supported on both standard and<br/>
composite resolvers.   Is this a doc mistake or a bug?<br/>
http://ant.apache.org/ivy/history/latest-milestone/settings/resolvers.html
