                                            <td class="description">      Some pom.xmls contains a &lt;license&gt; without a &lt;name&gt;, which is allowed according to the maven pom xsd. This generates a ivy.xml in ~/.ivy2 which cannot be schema validated according to ivy.xsd, and thus cannot be used by the cache resolver.<br/>

