                <tr id="issuerow12407387" rel="12407387" data-issuekey="IVY-959" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-959" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-959">IVY-959</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Listing of URL&#39;s under a given URL does not handle fully specified URL&#39;s
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Bug</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Resolved
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    Fixed
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">            Maarten Coene
    </td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Randy Nott
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Randy Nott
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 29/Oct/08 04:16 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 17/Mar/09 22:31 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> 29/Oct/08 22:53 </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">                        2.1.0-RC1            </td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">0</td>
                                            <td class="watches">1</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Listing of URL&#39;s under a given URL does not handle fully specified URL&#39;s thus failing resolution of dynamic versions with certain repositories. The following example is a directory listing returned by the Sonatype Nexus repository manager:<br/>
<br/>
&lt;html&gt;<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;head&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;title&gt;Index of /nexus/content/repositories/releases/myorganization/mymodule/&lt;/title&gt;<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;/head&gt;<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;body&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;h1&gt;Index of /nexus/content/repositories/releases/myorganization/mymodule/&lt;/h1&gt;<br/>
<br/>
    &lt;table cellspacing=&quot;10&quot;&gt;<br/>
<br/>
      &lt;tr&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;th align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;Name&lt;/th&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;th&gt;Last Modified&lt;/th&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;th&gt;Size&lt;/th&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;th&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;<br/>
<br/>
      &lt;/tr&gt;<br/>
<br/>
      &lt;tr&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;td&gt;<br/>
<br/>
          &lt;a href=&quot;http://example.com/nexus/content/repositories/releases/myorganization/&quot;&gt;Parent Directory<br/>
<br/>
&lt;/a&gt;<br/>
<br/>
        &lt;/td&gt;<br/>
<br/>
      &lt;/tr&gt;<br/>
<br/>
                  &lt;tr&gt;<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;td&gt;<br/>
<br/>
                              &lt;a href=&quot;http://example.com/nexus/content/repositories/releases/myorganization/mymodule/1.0/&quot;&gt;1.0/&lt;/a&gt;<br/>
<br/>
                          &lt;/td&gt;<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;<br/>
<br/>
              Tue Oct 28 00:41:33 PDT 2008<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;/td&gt;<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;td align=&quot;center&quot;&gt;<br/>
<br/>
                              -<br/>
<br/>
                          &lt;/td&gt;<br/>
<br/>
          &lt;/tr&gt;<br/>
<br/>
            &lt;/table&gt;<br/>
<br/>
  &lt;/body&gt;<br/>
<br/>
&lt;/html&gt;<br/>
<br/>
The current implementation fails as it only supports the URL as a path (no protocol or server/port).<br/>
<br/>
A patch to add support for full URL&#39;s is attached.<br/>

  </td>
