  </td>
                                            <td class="description">      Ivy is working very well with our setup. <br/>
We are using ivy standalone + nant + subversion.<br/>
<br/>
Any way the issue is when a dll has same size as the previous but the versionnumber might diff then it wont publish the new dependencies because the overwrite is set to false.<br/>
<br/>
It would be nice to be able to set this somewhere, mabe in the commandline. Doesnt matter as long as there is a posiblity.<br/>
<br/>
Thanks in advance.
