                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      I tested this against rc2 and current trunk.<br/>
<br/>
If you call &lt;ivy:retrieve&gt; and one of the modules to retireve contains custom attributes within the default namespace ivy fails, although the ivysetting have the validate flag set to false.<br/>
<br/>
Howto Reproduce:<br/>
Download the zip file an extract the files. Put an ivy jar in the same directory or change the path withing build.xml.<br/>
run &#39;ant publish&#39;. Afterwards run &#39;ant retrieve&#39;. The retrieve fails.
