                <tr id="issuerow12412184" rel="12412184" data-issuekey="IVY-1003" class="issuerow">
                                            <td class="project">    Ivy
</td>
                                            <td class="issuekey">

    <a class="issue-link" data-issue-key="IVY-1003" href="https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IVY-1003">IVY-1003</a>
</td>
                                            <td class="summary"><p>
                Add support for transitive retrieval of source and javadoc artifacts
    </p>
</td>
                                            <td class="issuetype"> Improvement</td>
                                            <td class="status">
                Open
    </td>
                                            <td class="priority">   Major
</td>
                                            <td class="resolution">    <em>Unresolved</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="assignee">    <em>Unassigned</em>
</td>
                                            <td class="reporter">            Erik-Berndt Scheper
    </td>
                                            <td class="creator">            Erik-Berndt Scheper
    </td>
                                            <td class="created"> 12/Jan/09 11:24 </td>
                                            <td class="lastViewed"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="updated"> 02/Jul/15 14:49 </td>
                                            <td class="resolutiondate"> &nbsp; </td>
                                            <td class="versions">                        2.0-RC2            </td>
                                            <td class="fixVersions">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="components">                        Core            </td>
                                            <td class="duedate">    &nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="votes">19</td>
                                            <td class="watches">17</td>
                                            <td class="thumbnail"></td>
                                            <td class="timeoriginalestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timeestimate"></td>
                                            <td class="timespent"></td>
                                            <td class="workratio">&nbsp;
</td>
                                            <td class="subtasks">                </td>
                                            <td class="issuelinks">                </td>
                                            <td class="environment"></td>
                                            <td class="description">      Currently, IVY only supports retrieving &#39;jar&#39; artifacts transitively (using the &#39;transitive&#39; attribute of a dependency), as documented [here|http://ant.apache.org/ivy/history/trunk/ivyfile/dependency.html].<br/>
<br/>
It would be very nice if IVY would also support transitive retrieval of the source and javadoc artifacts. <br/>
This would require two extra attributes for the dependency element:<br/>
* transitive-source<br/>
* transitive-javadoc<br/>
<br/>
To ensure backwards compatibility, these attributes should be optional and should default to false.
  </td>
